        array("id" => "s2015e14", "season" => 2015, "number" => 14, "name" => "A United Front – Luffy's Breakthrough to Victory", "airdate" => "26 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "The Tontattas locate their captive comrades and seem to be able to get the message to them - the prison break is on! Meanwhile, heavy-hitters from the Colosseum turn from wringing each other`s necks towards a unified plan, which might just be enough to get Lu…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741039.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e15", "season" => 2015, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Second Samurai – Evening Shower Kanjuro Appears", "airdate" => "3 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "Hidden far underground, Kin`emon finds his old friend Kanjuro, whose powers allow the two to, quickly, but not elegantly, escape to the surface! Meanwhile, Cavendish shares his fears that the \"Birdcage\" game Doflamingo is playing has been rigged all along - a…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741040.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e16", "season" => 2015, "number" => 16, "name" => "The Struggle with Pica – Zoro's One Finishing Move", "airdate" => "10 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "The Tontattas are in full revolt! But can they keep their wits about them long enough to make it out? Meanwhile, Zoro finally gains the upper hand against Pica, and Franky finds a way to deal with Señor Pink.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741042.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e17", "season" => 2015, "number" => 17, "name" => "The Little People's Princess - Captive Mansherry", "airdate" => "17 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Franky finally makes it into the factory and the Tontattas are reunited with their captive friends! But Princess Mansherry is nowhere to be found. Factory manager Kuween becomes irate when ignored and launches an attack on Franky while Señor Pink, wise to Fra…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741043.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e18", "season" => 2015, "number" => 18, "name" => "Invulnerable! The Terrifying Headcracker Doll Army", "airdate" => "24 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Robin, Rebecca, and Bartolomeo draw closer to the Flower Field on the fourth level of the Royal Palace plateau, but a sudden attack by Gladius exploding spheres sends Robin and Bartolomeo hurtling towards the level below - and directly into Luffy and the othe…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741044.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e19", "season" => 2015, "number" => 19, "name" => "Life-Risking! Luffy is the Trump Card to Victory", "airdate" => "31 May 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Rebecca makes it to the Flower Field alone, but unfortunately finds company there that is less than friendly! Meanwhile, Bartolomeo pushes himself to the limit in order to help Luffy advance, but does he leave himself vulnerable in the process? Meanwhile, Sab…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741045.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e20", "season" => 2015, "number" => 20, "name" => "A Tearful Reunion – Rebecca and Kyros!", "airdate" => "7 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Diamante has Rebecca pinned and completely overpowered. If only the Soldier-san of her youth were able to protect her! Meanwhile, Luffy and Law finally surmount incredible odds to land themselves in striking distance of Doflamingo -- but Sugar stands in their…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741046.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e21", "season" => 2015, "number" => 21, "name" => "One Shot One Kill - The Man Who Will Save Dressrosa", "airdate" => "14 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Usopp uses Viola`s Clairvoyance to prepare his ammunition to take Sugar out! But the slightest hesitation now will spell disaster -- and the end of Luffy! Luckily for the Straw Hats, Usopp`s ammunition has been specially designed for this specific situation!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741047.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e22", "season" => 2015, "number" => 22, "name" => "Anger Explosion - Luffy and Laws's Ultimate Secret Plan", "airdate" => "21 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The final showdown with Doflamingo begins, but the Warlord still has several tricks up his sleeve - including turning one of Luffy`s own friends against him! Meanwhile Franky and Señor Pink are in a standoff to find out who is the coolest.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741048.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e23", "season" => 2015, "number" => 23, "name" => "Noble Family - Doflamingo's True Identity!", "airdate" => "28 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "All hopes rest on Luffy and Law being able to take down Doflamingo; but the Warlord has other plans in mind as he gives the two the fight of their lives, and reveals his true, shocking history! Meanwhile, Sabo finds out Fujitora's true intention…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741050.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e24", "season" => 2015, "number" => 24, "name" => "Ultimate Power - The Secret of the Ope Ope no Mi!", "airdate" => "5 Jul 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "With Fujitora`s stalemate arousing suspicion in the Navy ranks, Law and Luffy stand seconds away from execution at the hand of Doflamingo! But before he dispatches them both, he shares the secret of his sway over the Celestial Dragons!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741051.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e25", "season" => 2015, "number" => 25, "name" => "Sad Memories - Law the Boy from the White City!", "airdate" => "12 Jul 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "The horrible secret of Flevance, the White Town, is revealed, giving clues to Law`s traumatic past! A rage born from the lies of the World Government created a child who had the will to kill Corazon!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741053.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e26", "season" => 2015, "number" => 26, "name" => "Celestial Dragon! Doffy's Stormy Past!", "airdate" => "19 Jul 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Law`s attack on Corazon looks less successful than he thought! And after he`s accepted into the Doflamingo Family, Corazon`s mysterious silence hides a fact that may save Law`s life - and a hidden danger Law must face in Doflamingo himself!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741055.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e27", "season" => 2015, "number" => 27, "name" => "A Rocky Road! – Law and Corazon's Journey of Life!", "airdate" => "2 Aug 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.9, "summary" => "Things grow stranger for Law as he learns the secret behind why Corazon feigns being mute! But the mysterious Corazon`s actions are only beginning to baffle Law as he takes him on a journey to cure his White Lead Disease.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741056.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e28", "season" => 2015, "number" => 28, "name" => "The Time is Ticking Down! Seize the Op-Op Fruit!", "airdate" => "9 Aug 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Corazon`s double-dealing with the Navy raises suspicions both with Doflamingo and Law. But all that is secondary as Corazon finally has a chance to grab the Op-Op Fruit during a staged handoff arranged by the Government.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741057.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e29", "season" => 2015, "number" => 29, "name" => "The Moment of Resolution: Corazon's Farewell Smile!", "airdate" => "16 Aug 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "The Op-Op Fruit is in Corazon`s hands! But the price he paid to get it might be too high... When Law goes for help, unfortunate coincidences intervene and leave the two vulnerable! Meanwhile, Doflamingo and his clan finally land at Minion Island; the location…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741174.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e30", "season" => 2015, "number" => 30, "name" => "Advance, Law! The Kindhearted Man's Final Fight!", "airdate" => "23 Aug 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Doflamingo and his Family begin to zero in on Corazon and Law`s whereabouts, but Corazon has a plan to hide Law long enough to let him escape - even if that means sacrificing his own life. However, when things turn sour, it`s a chain of lucky coincidences tha…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741175.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e31", "season" => 2015, "number" => 31, "name" => "To Be Free! Law's Injection Shot Blasts!", "airdate" => "30 Aug 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Violet runs down the status of the open battles raging in Dressrosa - the Straw Hats, the Tontattas, the executives of the Doflamingo Family - all of them clash around the island, but it`s Law`s revelation to Doflamingo that moves the action forward!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741176.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e32", "season" => 2015, "number" => 32, "name" => "An Intense Battle! Law vs. Doflamingo!", "airdate" => "6 Sep 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Luffy continues to battle Fake-mingo, but keeps accidentally battling Bellamy instead. Meanwhile the tide of battle turns against Law as painful scars from the past resurface. And Zoro gets unexpected help in his battle with Pica.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741177.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e33", "season" => 2015, "number" => 33, "name" => "A Decisive Battle Against the Executives! Proud Hajrudin!", "airdate" => "13 Sep 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Bellamy escapes Doflamingo`s control, but it might be too late. His long history with Doflamingo unfolds and leads to an inglorious end. Meanwhile, Hajrudin has been beaten down, but a fire still burns in him to pay back the favor he owes!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741178.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e34", "season" => 2015, "number" => 34, "name" => "The Battle of Love! The New Leader Sai vs. Baby 5!", "airdate" => "20 Sep 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Lao G and Don Chin Jao duke it out as each brings their most devastating attacks to the battle. But a misunderstanding caused by Baby 5 has Sai and Don Chin Jao distracted - are they distracted enough for Lao G to gain the upper hand?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741179.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e35", "season" => 2015, "number" => 35, "name" => "The Man's Pride - Bellamy's Last Charge!", "airdate" => "27 Sep 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Law is at the whim of Doflamingo and Trebol, while Luffy still has to deal with Bellamy, who fights to keep his honor even after being released by Doflamingo! Meanwhile, Gladius is about to detonate the ground around Cavendish and Bartolomeo!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741180.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e36", "season" => 2015, "number" => 36, "name" => "Storm and Stress! Hakuba vs. Dellinger!", "airdate" => "4 Oct 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "A mysterious force that resembles Cavendish menaces the battlefield - but while it appears to help Bartolomeo and the others at first, it sets its sights on Robin! Meanwhile, the deeply-wounded Ideo sees Dellinger's horrible true nature!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741181.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e37", "season" => 2015, "number" => 37, "name" => "Barrier-Barrier! Homage God Fist Strikes!", "airdate" => "11 Oct 2015", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Bartolomeo is in a neck and neck battle against Gladius to save Robin, and is faced with an impossible dilemma. With all his options leading to their defeat, can his cunning ploy save the day? Meanwhile, Robin is face to face with Cavendish, but his evil aspe…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741182.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e38", "season" => 2015, "number" => 38, "name" => "The Healing Princess! Save Mansherry", "airdate" => "18 Oct 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Princess Mansherry`s amazing power - to heal living beings completely - is in the hands of the Donquixote executive. If she is able to heal all the executives who`ve gone down in battle - the Straw Hats and their allies stand no chance! It`s up to Leo to save…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741183.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e39", "season" => 2015, "number" => 39, "name" => "The Manly Duel! Señor's Elegy of Love!", "airdate" => "25 Oct 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Señor Pink and Franky continue their knock-down, drag-out, manly fight. As both of them are pushed to their limits, we learn Señor`s tragic past! Meanwhile, Princess Mansherry`s rescue hits a snag as she stubbornly refuses to leave!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741184.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e40", "season" => 2015, "number" => 40, "name" => "Stardust of Death! Diamante's Storm of Vicious Attacks!", "airdate" => "1 Nov 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Franky and Señor Pink end their harrowing duel in a manly way - but victory knocks the wind out of even the winner`s sails! Meanwhile, Diamante and Kyros struggle desperately on the Sunflower Field, each demonstrating their extreme prowess even in near defeat!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741185.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e41", "season" => 2015, "number" => 41, "name" => "Trueno Bastardo! Kyros' Furious Strike!", "airdate" => "8 Nov 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Kyros, unbowed by Diamante`s vicious attacks, fights back with the anger and retribution of all of Dressrosa in order to fulfill his promise to protect Rebecca. If he is successful, only a few executives will remain, setting the stage for the Straw Hats` vict…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741186.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e42", "season" => 2015, "number" => 42, "name" => "Moving Across the Ground! The Giant Statue Pica's Surprise Maneuver!", "airdate" => "15 Nov 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Pica loses his temper and turns his full wrath against King Riku, whom he hopes to destroy, ending the revolution against Doflamingo. Meanwhile, Zoro, who has been distracted by Pica and drawn far from the battle, has to hatch a plan to save the king!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741187.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e43", "season" => 2015, "number" => 43, "name" => "A Decisive Battle in Midair! Zoro's New Special Secret Technique Blasts!", "airdate" => "22 Nov 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "With the lives of King Riku, Usopp, and the others on the old King`s Plateau in the balance, Zoro must dig deep and discover a powerful technique to counter Pica`s near-unstoppable onslaught. Meanwhile, King Riku ponders what it means to be a good king.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741188.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e44", "season" => 2015, "number" => 44, "name" => "So Long! Bellamy's Farewell Blow!", "airdate" => "29 Nov 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Zoro finishes off Pica, and those below his crumbling body rush to find shelter. Meanwhile, the Tontattas finish up demolishing the SMILE Factory, and Luffy`s hand is forced in his duel with Bellamy!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741189.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e45", "season" => 2015, "number" => 45, "name" => "Law Dies - Luffy's Raging Onslaught!", "airdate" => "6 Dec 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Taking down Bellamy only enrages Luffy in his fight against Doflamingo, his anger multiplying when he finds Law`s lifeless body! Meanwhile, Doflamingo takes the next step to end the game he started, which will endanger everybody in Dressrosa!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741190.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e46", "season" => 2015, "number" => 46, "name" => "A Blade of Tenacity! The Gamma Knife Counterattack!", "airdate" => "13 Dec 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "The Birdcage draws tighter and tighter around Dressrosa, threatening to destroy all life on the island kingdom! Meanwhile, Doflamingo stands down Luffy for a final confrontation, but a surprising twist shocks everyone on the top of the Royal Palace!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741191.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e47", "season" => 2015, "number" => 47, "name" => "A Collision of Haki! Luffy vs. Doflamingo!", "airdate" => "20 Dec 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Law`s attack proves powerful - but Doflamingo`s power has depths which he and Luffy haven`t bargained for. When Doflamingo makes his counterattack, Luffy stares him down with an amazing power.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741192.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e48", "season" => 2015, "number" => 48, "name" => "Unassailable! The Stunning Secret of Trebol", "airdate" => "27 Dec 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Trebol`s wrath is fully inflamed as Law summons enough energy to speak, denouncing the Doflamingo Family executives as pawns in Doflamingo`s game. But Law gathers enough energy to do more than just speak out.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741193.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2016, "name" => "#725 - #770", "rating" => 8.9, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2016e1", "season" => 2016, "number" => 1, "name" => "Anger Erupts! I Will Take Everything upon Myself!", "airdate" => "10 Jan 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Cavendish has to make a difficult decision when the severely wounded Law begs him to be left behind. Meanwhile, seeing even his Second Gear or Third Gear attacks aren`t working against Doflamingo, Luffy decides to use his ultimate technique!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741194.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e2", "season" => 2016, "number" => 2, "name" => "Fourth Gear! The Phenomenal Bounce-man!", "airdate" => "17 Jan 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Luffy and Doflamingo duke it out while the Birdcage tightens its grip on Dressrosa! Zoro sets off with a plan to stop it from slicing apart the country, while Luffy`s Fourth Gear proves quite potent against Doflamingo!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741195.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e3", "season" => 2016, "number" => 3, "name" => "A Massive Counterattack! Doflamingo's Awakening!", "airdate" => "24 Jan 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The Birdcage continues its merciless constriction, sending the residents of Dressrosa fleeing towards the center of the island, while King Riku calls out to his people; survive long enough for Luffy to vanquish the last of the royal family - Doflamingo himsel…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741196.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e4", "season" => 2016, "number" => 4, "name" => "Luffy! An All-Out Leo Bazooka!", "airdate" => "31 Jan 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Fourth Gear gives Luffy the power he needs to head off Doflamingo at every strike! But the energy required to keep Fourth Gear going starts to take a toll on Luffy. Will he have enough left to finish the job?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741197.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e5", "season" => 2016, "number" => 5, "name" => "Flame Dragon King! Protect Luffy's Life!", "airdate" => "14 Feb 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Bounce-man`s power has drained Luffy, leaving him in need of a rest before he can reuse his Haki, but luckily the gladiators from the Colosseum have come around and are focusing on taking down Doflamingo! Sabo steps in at a crucial moment to defend his brothe…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741198.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e6", "season" => 2016, "number" => 6, "name" => "Tears of Miracles! Mansherry's Fight!", "airdate" => "21 Feb 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "With Luffy and so many of the Straw Hats` allies incapacitated, victory seems inevitable for Doflamingo - but the compassion of Mansherry may be enough to turn the tide and renew their hope - to stop the Birdcage!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741199.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e7", "season" => 2016, "number" => 7, "name" => "As Long as We Breathe! Stop the Deadly Birdcage", "airdate" => "28 Feb 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "With just over a minute to spare, everyone in Dressrosa turns their efforts towards slowing down the Birdcage as it squeezes the life out of the country! Meanwhile, Viola seeks Doflamingo out herself, for a shocking confrontation!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741200.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e8", "season" => 2016, "number" => 8, "name" => "Dead or Alive! A Fateful Countdown", "airdate" => "6 Mar 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Only a bit more time remains before Luffy returns to the scene! But as time slips by, those who had been roused by Princess Mansherry`s powers begin to falter! Meanwhile, Rebecca, under the control of Doflamingo, is about to attack Viola!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741201.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e9", "season" => 2016, "number" => 9, "name" => "Strike the Heavens - Luffy's King Kong Gun of Rage", "airdate" => "20 Mar 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Luffy regains enough Haki to face off against Doflamingo, but his health is still poor. With the Birdcage closing in, is there a technique left in his repertoire that is strong enough to take down Doflamingo?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741202.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e10", "season" => 2016, "number" => 10, "name" => "To Freedom! Dressrosa Overjoyed!", "airdate" => "27 Mar 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "With Doflamingo thoroughly quashed and the Birdcage collapsing, the people of Dressrosa shed tears of joy remembering the hardships they`ve endured, and the actions taken by Luffy and the others to free them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741203.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e11", "season" => 2016, "number" => 11, "name" => "Unprecedented - The Shocking Decision of Admiral Fujitora!", "airdate" => "3 Apr 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Jesus Burgess of the Blackbeard Pirates tries to agitate Sabo, mocking Ace`s final words in order to unsettle him enough that he can try to steal the Flare-Flare Fruit! Meanwhile, people of Dressrosa beg King Riku to resume the crown when Navy Admiral Fujitor…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741204.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e12", "season" => 2016, "number" => 12, "name" => "The World Trembles - The Worst Generation Advances!", "airdate" => "10 Apr 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Repercussions of Doflamingo`s defeat reverberate around the world! Fujitora`s actions put the Navy in a tight spot, and the \"Worst Generation\" beings to stir into action!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741205.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e13", "season" => 2016, "number" => 13, "name" => "The Birth of a Legend - The Adventure of Sabo the Revolutionary!", "airdate" => "17 Apr 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "The combatants in the battle for Dressrosa can finally begin to recoup, but those who stay awake are treated to the story of how Sabo joined the Revolutionary Army!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741206.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e14", "season" => 2016, "number" => 14, "name" => "The Brother's Bond - The Story of Luffy and Sabo's Reunion", "airdate" => "24 Apr 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Sabo recounts his surprising reunion with Luffy at the Colosseum as the Straw Hats and the others continue to recoup. Meanwhile, Fujitora gambles on how to make his next move - and the odds are in Luffy`s favor!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741207.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e15", "season" => 2016, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Strongest Creature - Kaido of the Beasts", "airdate" => "1 May 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "As Sabo departs, our attention shifts to the other Straw Hats waging a fierce battle on a mysterious island. And a new drama is set into motion as ill portents fall from the sky!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741208.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e16", "season" => 2016, "number" => 16, "name" => "Fujitora on the Move - The Straw Hats Completely Surrounded", "airdate" => "8 May 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "As Luffy and the others begin to come to their senses, major players in the Navy arrive to search Dressrosa for the Straw Hats! Also, Rebecca`s history is whitewashed with a fake cover story - but why?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741209.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e17", "season" => 2016, "number" => 17, "name" => "A State of Emergency! Rebecca Is Kidnapped!", "airdate" => "15 May 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Fujitora`s flirting with chance has turned out poorly for the Straw Hats as the full Navy force bears down on Dressrosa searching for the pirates! Luffy and the others make a mad dash for the east port to get off the island, but not without finishing up a pie…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741210.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e18", "season" => 2016, "number" => 18, "name" => "The Bond Between Father and Daughter! Kyros and Rebecca!", "airdate" => "22 May 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Rebecca has precious little time to follow Luffy`s lead and make it to Kyros. Can she make it in time? Meanwhile, Fujitora is closing in on Bartolomeo and the other Colosseum warriors while Trafalgar Law faces the shadows of his past!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741211.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e19", "season" => 2016, "number" => 19, "name" => "Manly Spirit - Luffy vs. Fujitora in a Head-to-Head Clash", "airdate" => "29 May 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Law and Sengoku share memories of Corazon, and the secret of Trafalgar Law`s name. Meanwhile, Fujitora uses the destruction caused by the battle in Dressrosa as a weapon, and squares off one-on-one with Luffy!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741212.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e20", "season" => 2016, "number" => 20, "name" => "No Way Out! Admiral Fujitora's Ruthless Pursuit!", "airdate" => "5 Jun 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.9, "summary" => "The people of Dressrosa show their appreciation to the Straw Hats one last time by foiling Fujitora`s strategy. As Luffy and the others are able to finally make their break from the island, however, an unbelievable new chapter opens in the story of the Straw…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741213.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e21", "season" => 2016, "number" => 21, "name" => "Sons' Cups - Straw Hat Fleet is Formed!", "airdate" => "12 Jun 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.9, "summary" => "With newfound allies won in the battle at Dressrosa, and as the Navy watches, Luffy and the Straw Hats depart Dressrosa for open water. But will Luffy accept the oath of allegiance given by his new fleet?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741214.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e22", "season" => 2016, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Numerous Rivals Struggle Amongst Themselves - The Raging Monsters of the New World", "airdate" => "19 Jun 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.9, "summary" => "While the Straw Hats are underway, Doflamingo has serious predictions for the upset of the world order! Meanwhile, the recent actions in Dressrosa have led to surprising results!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741215.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e23", "season" => 2016, "number" => 23, "name" => "The Silver Fortress – The Great Adventures of Luffy and Bart", "airdate" => "26 Jun 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 6.3, "summary" => "While heading to the next island, Zou, Luffy's appetite causes them trouble and he and Bartolomeo find themselves entangled in the scheme of a pirate lord who can manipulate silver.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741273.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e24", "season" => 2016, "number" => 24, "name" => "An Underground Labyrinth – Luffy vs Mine Cart Man", "airdate" => "3 Jul 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7, "summary" => "The Tram-Man arrives! And has Luffy, Bartolomeo and Desire on the run! The deeper the three fall into the pit, however, the more clear it becomes that Bill`s group hides a terrible secret!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741275.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e25", "season" => 2016, "number" => 25, "name" => "The Sword Technique Heats Up! Law and Zoro Finally Appear!", "airdate" => "10 Jul 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Luffy, Bartolomeo, and Desire make their way up the mineshaft, but Bill`s assassin, Peseta, has other plans! Just when the going gets tough, help arrives, and Zoro battles the assassin head on!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741276.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e26", "season" => 2016, "number" => 26, "name" => "A Desperate Situation! Luffy Fights a Battle in Extreme Heat!", "airdate" => "17 Jul 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Luffy, Desire, and Bartolomeo go up against Bill! But the mad, Smelt-Smelt man becomes deranged and lets his true power unfurl! Do Luffy and the others have any hope of exposing Bill`s self-serving aims and turning his gang against him?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741277.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e27", "season" => 2016, "number" => 27, "name" => "The Start of a New Adventure - Arrival at the Mysterious Island, 'Zou'!", "airdate" => "31 Jul 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Bartolomeo recounts the formation of the Straw Hats, sharing their moving story with the rest of his crew! Meanwhile, the mysterious island of Zou approaches in the distance, obscured by fog. But when the haze clears, no one is expecting what they see!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741279.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e28", "season" => 2016, "number" => 28, "name" => "The New Shichibukai - Son of the Legendary Whitebeard Arrives", "airdate" => "7 Aug 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Luffy and the others arrive at the mysterious land of Zou, and find the Sunny. But when they board, they find the other Straw Hats have already disembarked. Thus, Luffy, Zoro, Robin and the others take on the challenge of climbing the monstrous elephant!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741280.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e29", "season" => 2016, "number" => 29, "name" => "A Deadly Elephant Climb - A Great Adventure on the Back of the Giant Elephant!", "airdate" => "21 Aug 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.1, "summary" => "Finally scaling the elephant`s back, the Straw Hats continue their search for the other half of their crew! But the mysterious \"island\" on the back of the elephant may hold more danger than they bargained for, as they learn they are not alone!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741281.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e30", "season" => 2016, "number" => 30, "name" => "Battle Starts! Luffy vs. the Mink Tribe!", "airdate" => "28 Aug 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Luffy pushes deeper into the mysterious forest on the elephant's back, but he`s treading in territory where is not welcome! Meanwhile, Usopp and the others make a startling discovery in a ruined city!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741282.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e31", "season" => 2016, "number" => 31, "name" => "Garchu! The Straw Hat Crew Reunites", "airdate" => "4 Sep 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Luffy and the others survive the Rain-Ruption and learn of its vital role in maintaining life on Zou. They continue on towards the fortress learning more about the mysterious Mink Tribe, and are finally reunited with the others - but is that the whole story?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741283.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e32", "season" => 2016, "number" => 32, "name" => "The Counterattack Begins! The Curly Hat Pirates moves out!", "airdate" => "11 Sep 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Luffy and the others are unexpectedly welcomed at the fortress and treated well by the Minks, although they have to navigate some cultural differences… And Nami starts sharing what happened to them after they left Dressrosa.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741284.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e33", "season" => 2016, "number" => 33, "name" => "An Incoming Threat - Jack of the Beasts Pirates!", "airdate" => "25 Sep 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Luffy and the others learn about the dangerous intruders who have come to Zou, and why the island is wrecked! Afterwards, Luffy`s loose lips get them into trouble!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741285.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e34", "season" => 2016, "number" => 34, "name" => "Ruler of Day - Enter Duke Inuarashi!", "airdate" => "2 Oct 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Duke Dogstorm - the Straw Hats finally meet the ruler of this strange land, and learn more about the battle that took place here; and the mysterious system by which the island is ruled!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741286.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e35", "season" => 2016, "number" => 35, "name" => "Ruler of Night - Nekomamushi Appears", "airdate" => "9 Oct 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Day turns to night as the Minks keep up their onslaught against the invading Beast Pirates! But Jack`s amazing Devil Fruit power may end the elephant island once and for all!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741287.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e36", "season" => 2016, "number" => 36, "name" => "The Exterminated Capital! The Twirly Hat Crew Arrive!", "airdate" => "16 Oct 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Night and day, Jack faces the fury of the two sworn defenders of Zou, but while they put up a good fight, the Minks aren`t able to subdue Jack, especially after he brings out his secret weapon...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741288.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e37", "season" => 2016, "number" => 37, "name" => "The Time Limit Closes in! The Bond Between the Mink Tribe and the Crew!", "airdate" => "23 Oct 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "In the aftermath of Jack`s deadly attack on the island of Zou, Chopper and Sanji rush in to save the fallen Mink Tribe - but they will need the help of Caesar to overcome the poisonous effects of the gas!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741289.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e38", "season" => 2016, "number" => 38, "name" => "The Delinquent Comes Home! Emperor Big Mom's Assassins!", "airdate" => "30 Oct 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "More of the dramatic happenings on Zou are revealed as we learn that Jack`s pirate band were not the only visitors to the elephant island! And what about the mysterious fate of Sanji?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741290.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e39", "season" => 2016, "number" => 39, "name" => "The Truth Behind His Disappearance – Sanji's Shocking Invitation", "airdate" => "6 Nov 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "The mystery of Sanji`s disappearance deepens as Luffy learns that Big Mom`s lackeys have caught up with him and the rest - and carry with them an invitation from Big Mom that simply can`t be refused!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741291.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e40", "season" => 2016, "number" => 40, "name" => "To My Buds! Sanji's Farewell Note!", "airdate" => "13 Nov 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Sanji`s dire situation has become clear, but instead of rallying against Big Mom`s crew, he submits to go along with them to bring an end to this situation. But being separated from one of his crew is more than Luffy is willing to tolerate!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741292.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e41", "season" => 2016, "number" => 41, "name" => "Let's Go See Master Nekomamushi", "airdate" => "20 Nov 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "There`s only one key to finding out what happened to Sanji - and Luffy and the others make their way towards finding out more about their friend`s disappearance, but on their way the indigenous fauna give them trouble!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741293.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e42", "season" => 2016, "number" => 42, "name" => "Luffy's Decision - The Sanji Abdication Crisis!", "airdate" => "27 Nov 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Luffy hatches a plan to help Sanji, but he`ll have to go alone to avoid an all-out war with Big Mom. Meanwhile, Kin`emon and Kanjuro finally arrive at Zou, unwittingly setting the stage for the Minks` thirst for revenge!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741294.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e43", "season" => 2016, "number" => 43, "name" => "An Explosive Situation – Dog, Cat, and Samurai!", "airdate" => "4 Dec 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The samurai have landed! And they make their way into the country of Zou unaware of the welcome they will receive by the Minks! The Straw Hats try their best to stop the fight - but as day meets night and Cat Viper and Dogstorm face each other, tensions run h…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741295.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e44", "season" => 2016, "number" => 44, "name" => "The Third One! Raizo of the Mist, the Ninja, Appears!", "airdate" => "11 Dec 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Revelations abound as the true nature of the Wano clan and their relationship with the Minks is revealed! Momonosuke`s role is greater than any had imagined! But even more shocking - the visage of Raizo the Ninja!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741296.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e45", "season" => 2016, "number" => 45, "name" => "A Red Stone! A Guide to the One Piece!", "airdate" => "18 Dec 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The mysteries of ninjutsu enthrall the Straw Hats as Raizo, the implausible ninja, makes his true powers known! Meanwhile, a mysterious artifact points the way towards the end of the Grand Line!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741297.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2016e46", "season" => 2016, "number" => 46, "name" => "The Secret of the Land of Wano! The Kozuki Family and the Ponegliffs!", "airdate" => "25 Dec 2016", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "The mystery of the Ponegliffs is revealed - their true significance, and the story of their creation, leads closer to the Straw Hats than they might have imagined!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741298.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2017, "name" => "#771 - #819", "rating" => 8.7, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2017e1", "season" => 2017, "number" => 1, "name" => "A Vow Between Two Men - Luffy and Kozuki Momonosuke", "airdate" => "8 Jan 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "More mysteries of the Kozuki Clan are revealed - and the samurai propose an alliance to help topple Kaido! But Luffy`s response will shock the crew... and force the young daimyo to take responsibility!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741299.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e2", "season" => 2017, "number" => 2, "name" => "The Legendary Journey! The Dog and the Cat and the Pirate King!", "airdate" => "15 Jan 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Dogstorm and Cat Viper share their story of being on the journey with Oden and Roger but are interrupted by Nami who is concerned about the sea route. Meanwhile, Jack is plotting to bring down the Mokomo Dukedom again!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741300.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e3", "season" => 2017, "number" => 3, "name" => "Returning Nightmare - Assault of the Invulnerable Jack", "airdate" => "22 Jan 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "The plans are set! The Straw Hats divide and conquer, one group heading to save Sanji, the others to the Land of Wano! But in the final moments before their departure, the tremendous elephant island begins to quake!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741301.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e4", "season" => 2017, "number" => 4, "name" => "Defensive Battle of Zou - Luffy and Zunisha!", "airdate" => "29 Jan 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "After being aggressively attacked by Jack`s fleet, the monstrous Zunesha comes to life and beckons to those on its back! But can the Straw Hats understand its cry? And realize in time what the elephant island needs from them?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741302.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e5", "season" => 2017, "number" => 5, "name" => "Save Zunesha! The Straw Hat's Rescue Operation!", "airdate" => "5 Feb 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "With the skirmish with Jack now over, the Straw Hats move on to trying to bandage the great elephant`s wounds! But just as the whole island puts the plan into action, unseen danger lurks on horizon!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741303.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e6", "season" => 2017, "number" => 6, "name" => "Saying Goodbye and Descending from the Elephant! Setting Out to Take Back Sanji!", "airdate" => "12 Feb 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "The Straw Hats and the others split up into four teams, each on different missions! Some from the Mink Tribe insist on leaving with Luffy's team! Meanwhile, Usopp makes a weapon for Nami that seems to work like magic!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741304.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e7", "season" => 2017, "number" => 7, "name" => "To the Reverie - Princess Vivi and Princess Shirahoshi", "airdate" => "19 Feb 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Luffy`s team sets out from Zou on their way to win back Sanji! But they didn`t realize there is one more crewmember than they have bargained for! Meanwhile, the leading families and leaders of the world make their way to Mariejois for the pivotal world meetin…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741703.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e8", "season" => 2017, "number" => 8, "name" => "To the Reverie - Rebecca and the Sakura Kingdom", "airdate" => "26 Feb 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Carrot stows away! And settles in with the Straw Hats as they make their way to rescue Sanji! Meanwhile, in the Sakura Kingdom - formerly the Drum Kingdom, Dalton and Kureha are getting ready for the Reverie so as their former enemy in his newly-built kingdom…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741705.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e9", "season" => 2017, "number" => 9, "name" => "Kaido Returns - The Worst Generation Threatened!", "airdate" => "5 Mar 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "News of the raid on the Revolutionary Army reaches Luffy! But that`s the least of their worries as they face a storm and a sudden lack of provisions! Meanwhile, Emperor Kaido, furious at the loss of Joker, fumes with anger at the reckless generation of upstar…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741706.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e10", "season" => 2017, "number" => 10, "name" => "A Hungry Front - Luffy and the Marine Rookies!", "airdate" => "19 Mar 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7, "summary" => "Sneaking in to the Navy island facility to replenish their food supply, Luffy and the others risk being caught out in the open! Will their infamy make them easy to spot by the hotheaded Navy recruits around them?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741707.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e11", "season" => 2017, "number" => 11, "name" => "The Persistent Trio – The Great Pursuit for the Straw Hats!", "airdate" => "26 Mar 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "The jig is up as Luffy and the others make a daring dash to avoid the furious Navy! Can they escape without having to turn to fight - and after they`ve had a chance to raid the cabinets for food?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741708.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e12", "season" => 2017, "number" => 12, "name" => "Fist of the Devil – Showdown! Luffy vs. Grant", "airdate" => "2 Apr 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Making a mad dash for the Submerge with the food they stole, Luffy and the others have to get through some of the Navy`s upstart soldiers! Grount, whose arm holds incredible power, summons his training to challenge Luffy!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741709.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e13", "season" => 2017, "number" => 13, "name" => "Sanji's Homecoming! Into Big Mom's Territory!", "airdate" => "9 Apr 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "The Straw Hats continue to suffer from blazing heat and a perilous food crisis! As the seas finally calm, fishing is their only hope! Meanwhile, Sanji arrives in Big Mom`s territory and keeps his cool - until he sees his bride-to-be!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741710.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e14", "season" => 2017, "number" => 14, "name" => "Zero and Four! Encountering Germa 66!", "airdate" => "16 Apr 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Luffy is in danger as the venomous fish poison courses through his body! With no antidotes on board, the Straw Hats must rely on a mysterious ship for help - a ship that bears a truly surprising crew!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741711.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e15", "season" => 2017, "number" => 15, "name" => "A Deadly Poison Crisis - Luffy and Reiju!", "airdate" => "23 Apr 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "On the edge of life and death, Luffy`s only hope rests with Sanji`s siblings! But even though they refuse to share an antidote, they may be able to save Luffy`s life yet, giving him enough energy to plunge right back into trouble...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741712.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e16", "season" => 2017, "number" => 16, "name" => "Totto Land! Emperor Big Mom Appears", "airdate" => "30 Apr 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Arriving on Cacao Island, Luffy and Chopper are in heaven as everything before their eyes is edible! But in this most heavenly of places, there are rules to be obeyed - and consequences for breaking them! Luckily someone is on the lookout for the Straw Hats!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741713.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e17", "season" => 2017, "number" => 17, "name" => "The Yonko's Daughter – Sanji's Fiancée \"Pudding\"", "airdate" => "7 May 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The Straw Hats confront Pudding - the fiancée of Sanji! But when they challenge her for Sanji`s heart, her answer shocks them! Meanwhile an ominous and mysterious message may spell doom for the Straw Hats...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741714.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e18", "season" => 2017, "number" => 18, "name" => "A Massive Attack! Mom's Hunger Pangs", "airdate" => "14 May 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "The dangerous waters around the Whole Cake Island harbor terrifying creatures that pose a challenge for the Straw Hats! Meanwhile, Mama slips into a bout of her sickness and ravages her own land in search a specific pastry!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741715.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e19", "season" => 2017, "number" => 19, "name" => "The Capital City Falls?! Big Mom and Jimbei", "airdate" => "21 May 2017", "runtime" => 24, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Big Mom rampages through the Whole Cake Island in search for sweets - but when the kitchen can`t prepare them fast enough her own son steps in to curb the carnage, with deadly results. Only an old face coming across the waters brings Mom what she needs, even…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741716.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e20", "season" => 2017, "number" => 20, "name" => "The Yonko's Castle – Arrival on Whole Cake Island", "airdate" => "28 May 2017", "runtime" => 24, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "As the Straw Hats draw closer to the Whole Cake Island, Pedro shares his sordid past in Big Mom's territory - and hatches a plan to win back Sanji and take an item of great worth from the Emperor!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741717.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e21", "season" => 2017, "number" => 21, "name" => "A Mysterious Forest Full of Candies - Luffy vs. Luffy?!", "airdate" => "4 Jun 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Brook and Pedro head out in a submersible to infiltrate Big Mom`s stronghold! Meanwhile Luffy, Nami, Chopper and Carrot head into the island chasing the image of Sanji, only to be distracted by the endless supply of sweets and a second Luffy!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741718.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e22", "season" => 2017, "number" => 22, "name" => "Mom's Assassin! Luffy and the Seducing Woods!", "airdate" => "11 Jun 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Lost in the bewildering woods and chasing after Sanji, Nami and the others find there`s more than meets the eye in this upside down part of the Whole Cake Island! Meanwhile, Sanji confronts his brother!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741719.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e23", "season" => 2017, "number" => 23, "name" => "A Seafaring Kingdom! Germa's King Judge!", "airdate" => "18 Jun 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Luffy continues to move through the mysterious and dangerous woods, unaware of the danger that lurks in the trees! Meanwhile, Sanji confronts his father as the wounds of his childhood are laid bare!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741720.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e24", "season" => 2017, "number" => 24, "name" => "A Battle Between Father and Son - Judge vs. Sanji!", "airdate" => "25 Jun 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Sanji faces off against his father in a duel! His powerful kicks aim at protecting his hands, but the Germa Family has more in store for him yet! Meanwhile Luffy goes deeper into the Seducing Woods and falls for their powerful illusions!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741721.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e25", "season" => 2017, "number" => 25, "name" => "A Giant Ambition - Big Mom and Caesar", "airdate" => "2 Jul 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Big Mom has Caesar Clown at her whims - and despite his bilking her out of countless amounts of money - she is ready to continue her pursuit of maniacal world control! Meanwhile, Big Mom`s forces are on to the Straw Hats, and Pekoms faces a dire situation!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741722.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e26", "season" => 2017, "number" => 26, "name" => "The Land of Souls! Mom's Fatal Ability!", "airdate" => "9 Jul 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Finally Nami finds Luffy and recounts her harrowing tale of battling Brulee! Meanwhile the mysterious half-buried man comes clean about his true identity! But this must all be put aside when one of Mom`s most powerful generals comes calling!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741723.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e27", "season" => 2017, "number" => 27, "name" => "A Top Executive! One of the Three Commanders \"Cracker\" Appears", "airdate" => "16 Jul 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "The identity of the enigmatic Pound, the man half-buried in the woods, is revealed, but his deep connection to Big Mom might not be enough to save him! Nami`s past exploits, however, hold the key to keeping Mom`s minions at bay!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741724.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e28", "season" => 2017, "number" => 28, "name" => "An Enemy With 800 Million Bounty – Luffy vs. Thousand Arms Cracker", "airdate" => "23 Jul 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Luffy squares off against Cracker, one of the Sweet 3 Generals, as Nami learns the truth about others in the Worst Generation who have come before to challenge Big Mom!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741725.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e29", "season" => 2017, "number" => 29, "name" => "Full Force Showdown – Gear Fourth vs. Bisu Bisu Ability", "airdate" => "30 Jul 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Luffy continues to fight against Cracker, whose powers to manipulate his surroundings may prove more troublesome than he had thought! Meanwhile, Brook and Pedro infiltrate the Whole Cake Island - and must hatch a plan to avoid getting caught!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741726.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e30", "season" => 2017, "number" => 30, "name" => "The First and the Second Join! The Vinsmoke Family", "airdate" => "6 Aug 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The wind starts to go out of Luffy`s sails as he fights an endless army of Biscuit Warriors! Meanwhile, the oldest two Vinsmoke brothers come home from a war to see their long-missing young brother Sanji.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741727.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e31", "season" => 2017, "number" => 31, "name" => "The Benefactor's Life! Sanji and Owner Zeff!", "airdate" => "13 Aug 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Luffy starts to run out of steam as the Biscuit Warriors keep multiplying! If he can buy himself 10 minutes to recharge... Meanwhile, Sanji squares off against his family, but realizes they have some vital insurance to make sure he follows their scheme to mar…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741728.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e32", "season" => 2017, "number" => 32, "name" => "An Angry Sanji! The Secret of Germa 66!", "airdate" => "20 Aug 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Luffy needs just 10 minutes to recharge! Nami comes to rescue with the help of the Homies! Meanwhile, Sanji learns the terrible truth of Germa`s power - and his father`s dark history!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741729.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e33", "season" => 2017, "number" => 33, "name" => "The Past that He Let Go of! Vinsmoke Sanji!", "airdate" => "27 Aug 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Nami challenges Cracker on her own! During the all-out fight, she loses her advantage and is close to defeat. Can Luffy bounce back in time? Meanwhile, Sanji`s tragic childhood is made clear.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741730.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e34", "season" => 2017, "number" => 34, "name" => "To the East Blue! Sanji's Resolute Departure!", "airdate" => "3 Sep 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "The terrible history of Sanji`s family continue to unfold. From a rare moment of compassion he is able to escape, only to face his father`s cruelty before setting out on his own.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/126/315692.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e35", "season" => 2017, "number" => 35, "name" => "A Battle of Limits! Luffy and the Infinite Biscuits!", "airdate" => "17 Sep 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Luffy is in an all-out, all-you-can-eat battle! As Cracker`s endless stream of Biscuit Warriors marches on, Luffy`s endless appetite is put to the test. Meanwhile, Reiju helps Sanji to straighten himself out before he meets his fiancée.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/127/319838.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e36", "season" => 2017, "number" => 36, "name" => "Power of Fullness - New Gear Fourth Tankman!", "airdate" => "24 Sep 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Luffy needs to think fast in order to turn the battle in his favor - filled with biscuits he debuts a new Gear Four attack that has lasting repercussions! Meanwhile, Chopper and Carrot find Sanji`s reflection, but can they get a message to him in time?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/128/321895.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e37", "season" => 2017, "number" => 37, "name" => "A Heartbreaking Duel! Luffy vs Sanji! - Part 1", "airdate" => "1 Oct 2017", "runtime" => 60, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Sanji has memories of his escape from the Germa Kingdom, meeting Zeff, and later joining the Straw Hats as his family heads to the Whole Cake Chateau. Luffy and Nami ride King Baum out of the Seducing Woods, and they contact Chopper and Carrot, who reveal whe…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/129/323824.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e38", "season" => 2017, "number" => 38, "name" => "A Heartbreaking Duel! Luffy vs Sanji! - Part 2", "airdate" => "1 Oct 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Luffy refuses to back down from the hostile Sanji, causing Sanji to confront him and attack him with Diable Jambe. Despite Sanji's vicious attacks, Luffy refuses to fight back or retreat, and Nami pleads Sanji to stop to no avail. Finally, Sanji knocks Luffy…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/457/1143223.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e39", "season" => 2017, "number" => 39, "name" => "A Storm of Revenge! An Enraged Army Comes to Attack!", "airdate" => "15 Oct 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Luffy makes a solemn promise to not move from his spot until Sanji returns to him. But as Mama`s army advances, that promise may prove a costly one. Meanwhile, Sanji and the Vinsmokes come face to face with Big Mom and his bride-to-be Pudding!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/131/328757.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e40", "season" => 2017, "number" => 40, "name" => "The End of the Adventure - Sanji's Resolute Proposal", "airdate" => "22 Oct 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Luffy stands his ground and waits for his friend to return! But the vengeful army washes over him - only a true friend can step in to turn the tide of battle! Meanwhile, Sanji and Pudding discuss their marriage - and come to a startling conclusion!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/132/330293.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e41", "season" => 2017, "number" => 41, "name" => "I'll Wait Here - Luffy vs. the Enraged Army", "airdate" => "29 Oct 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Luffy puts his all into battling Big Mom`s vengeful army, however, their skills combined prove too formidable. Meanwhile, Sanji goes to Big Mom herself to bargain for the Straw Hats lives - with shocking results!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/133/332607.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e42", "season" => 2017, "number" => 42, "name" => "Infiltration Inside the Castle - Steal the Road Poneglyph", "airdate" => "5 Nov 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Chopper and Carrot are captured by Brulee and strung up for dinner! But Chopper sees a chance to free himself! Meanwhile, Brook and Pedro launch a plan to reach the Ponegliffs - a daring game of chance!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/133/334899.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e43", "season" => 2017, "number" => 43, "name" => "A Fateful Confrontation - Luffy and Big Mom", "airdate" => "12 Nov 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Pekoms creates a diversion for Brook to set his plan into action. Meanwhile Luffy continues to goad Big Mom into a fight, and Pudding begins to have stirrings of rebellion herself!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/134/337197.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e44", "season" => 2017, "number" => 44, "name" => "Shout of the Soul - Brook and Pedro's Lightning Operation", "airdate" => "19 Nov 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Just when Luffy and Nami are in Big Mom`s grasp, Pudding arrives, but with news that they aren`t expecting - meanwhile Brook and Chopper both make headway getting out of their own jams!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/135/339041.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e45", "season" => 2017, "number" => 45, "name" => "Goodbye! Pudding's Tearful Determination!", "airdate" => "26 Nov 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Sanji hopes his wedding with Pudding will solve the Straw Hat`s predicament - but Pudding secretly plans to to avoid the marriage, sharing a secret with Luffy. Meanwhile Brook comes face to face with Big Mom herself!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/136/341487.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e46", "season" => 2017, "number" => 46, "name" => "Fate of the Left Eye – Pedro vs Baron Tamago", "airdate" => "3 Dec 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Luffy tries desperately to free himself as the risk of his own well-being! Meanwhile, Chopper and Carrot continue to search the mirror universe, Brook squares off against Big Mom, and Pedro's past is revealed!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741702.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e47", "season" => 2017, "number" => 47, "name" => "Moist Cigarette! The Night Before Sanji's Wedding!", "airdate" => "10 Dec 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.9, "summary" => "Luffy struggles to break himself free as Sanji falls deeper in love with the idea of marrying Pudding... But the mask falls off and the deadly charade of Big Mom is revealed as the depths of her treachery come to light!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741819.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e48", "season" => 2017, "number" => 48, "name" => "The Undaunted Soul - Brook vs. Big Mom", "airdate" => "17 Dec 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Brook continues his all-out struggle against Big Mom, but his secret weapon might not be enough to save him! Meanwhile an unexpected ally from the past comes to the rescue!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741820.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2017e49", "season" => 2017, "number" => 49, "name" => "Sora's Wish! Germa's Failure - Sanji!", "airdate" => "24 Dec 2017", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Jimbei arrives on the scene and works to free Luffy and Nami! Meanwhile Sanji confronts his sister with the awful truth of Pudding, and she confides in him the powerful secret of their mother`s undying love!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741821.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2018, "name" => "#820 - #866", "rating" => 9, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2018e1", "season" => 2018, "number" => 1, "name" => "To Reach Sanji! Luffy's Vengeful Hell-bent Dash!", "airdate" => "7 Jan 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "Brook finds himself totally at the whim of Big Mom, and comes face to face with her brutal love! Meanwhile, Pedro reveals his explosive plan to create a distraction!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741822.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e2", "season" => 2018, "number" => 2, "name" => "The Chateau in Turmoil! Luffy, to the Rendezvous!", "airdate" => "14 Jan 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Chopper and Carrot use the mirror dimension to get in touch with Nami and Jimbei! Luffy makes it through more obstacles to learn that he just missed Sanji! Meanwhile, Sanji wonders alone about the best course of action.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741823.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e3", "season" => 2018, "number" => 3, "name" => "Deciding to Say Goodbye! Sanji and his Straw-Hat Bento!", "airdate" => "21 Jan 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Brook hears Big Mom`s plan firsthand as she shares her intentions with Pudding in front of him! Meanwhile Big Mom`s agents believe most of the Straw Hats to be under control, but doubt besets Montd`Or.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741824.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e4", "season" => 2018, "number" => 4, "name" => "Betraying One of the Four Emperors! The Great Brook Rescue Plan!", "airdate" => "28 Jan 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Nami and the others finally find Brook in the mirror dimension - but he`s in the most inopportune of places! Can they challenge the sleeping Mama and rescue their friend? Meanwhile, Luffy is waylaid on his way back to the rendezvous!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741825.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e5", "season" => 2018, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Rendezvous! Luffy, a One-on-One at His Limit!", "airdate" => "4 Feb 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Luffy puts up a valiant fight in order to keep his word to Sanji! But will he be able to last until Sanji arrives at the rendezvous? Meanwhile, Jimbei shares the awful truth about the wedding with the other Straw Hats.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741826.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e6", "season" => 2018, "number" => 6, "name" => "A Liar! Luffy and Sanji!!", "airdate" => "11 Feb 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Sanji and Luffy meet finally - and while he is happy to feed Luffy to replenish his energy, Sanji`s explanation of what actions he must take baffles Luffy! The crucial decision, to turn his back on his friends or his family, tears Sanji apart!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741827.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e7", "season" => 2018, "number" => 7, "name" => "Sanji Comes Back! Crash! The Tea Party from Hell!", "airdate" => "18 Feb 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The newly reunited Luffy and Sanji hear from the rest of the Straw Hats in the mirror dimension! Then, Jimbei starts telling them about Capone \"Gang\" Bege and proposes a shocking plan to take down Big Mom!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741828.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e8", "season" => 2018, "number" => 8, "name" => "A Secret Meeting! Luffy vs. The Fire Tank Pirates", "airdate" => "4 Mar 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The Straw Hats put Jimbei`s plan into action and approach Bege with the possibility of an alliance. But before they are granted an audience, they must make themselves presentable! At the same time, Nami learns about the terror of Big Mom from Lola`s twin sist…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741829.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e9", "season" => 2018, "number" => 9, "name" => "The Deadly Pact! Luffy & Bege's Allied Forces", "airdate" => "18 Mar 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The proposed alliance between the Straw Hats and Bege unfolds! A gaseous blast from the past, Gastino, a member of Bege`s team, reveals the secret weapon that the team plans to use against the Emperor! But Gastino is not who he seems, and the bait in this tra…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741830.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e10", "season" => 2018, "number" => 10, "name" => "Luffy Engages in a Secret Maneuver! The Wedding Full of Conspiracies Starts Soon!", "airdate" => "25 Mar 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Now, the assassination plan of Big Mom is all set and everyone starts preparing for the Tea Party. Montd`Or finds one of his crewmates, Bobbin the Disposer, dead, and suspects Sanji and Luffy of the crime. He goes to check if Sanji is in his room, just as San…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741831.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e11", "season" => 2018, "number" => 11, "name" => "The Family Gets Together! The Hellish Tea Party Starts!", "airdate" => "1 Apr 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "The day has arrived! Guests from the criminal underground pour in in droves, but some have their own agendas to settle! Big Mom's sons, however, stand in their way and show them what they've got! Meanwhile, Luffy is preparing for his own plan!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741832.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e12", "season" => 2018, "number" => 12, "name" => "The Broken Couple! Sanji and Pudding Enter!", "airdate" => "8 Apr 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Final preparations abound on all sides and multiple plots start to come together! But can Sanji keep his nerve and go through with the plan? Or will Pudding`s beauty prove too enchanting?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741833.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e13", "season" => 2018, "number" => 13, "name" => "A Deadly Kiss! The Mission to Assassinate the Emperor Kicks Off!", "airdate" => "15 Apr 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "All plans go into action as the moment of the wedding arrives - but as the veil is lifted on Pudding`s grotesque face, all hell breaks loose and unexpected circumstances mean chaos breaks out at the altar! Meanwhile, Luffy charges in, adding to the mayhem!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741834.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e14", "season" => 2018, "number" => 14, "name" => "Returning the Sake Cup! The Manly Jimbei Pays His Debt!", "airdate" => "22 Apr 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "The plan is launched! Big Mom falls to pieces as the wedding - and the wedding cake - are destroyed and a slew of Luffys are wreaking havoc around the site. But just when Luffy gets in trouble, Jimbei confronts Big Mom bravely!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741835.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e15", "season" => 2018, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Mission Failed?! The Big Mom Pirates Strike Back!", "airdate" => "29 Apr 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "The plan is in full swing however - Big Mom is pushed past the edge of sanity and can`t even bring herself to act. Meanwhile, her children make a move against Germa and Pudding takes up her original aim of killing Sanji!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741836.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e16", "season" => 2018, "number" => 16, "name" => "Run Sanji! SOS Germa 66!", "airdate" => "6 May 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "The plot is in full swing as Luffy dashes towards Big Mom to show her the broken portrait again! Sanji makes an effort to free his family and wins the respect of his sister and Big Mom loses her wits!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741837.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e17", "season" => 2018, "number" => 17, "name" => "Mom's Secret! The Giant's Island Elbaph and a Little Monster!", "airdate" => "13 May 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "The tragic and sad history of Big Mom is revealed! From abandonment, rescue, and again to ruin, Big Mom`s voracious hunger has brought her into conflict with others from the very beginning!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741838.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e18", "season" => 2018, "number" => 18, "name" => "The Birth of Mom - The Day That Carmel Vanished", "airdate" => "20 May 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Linlin enrages the Giants as she slays their respected warrior - but Mother throws herself on their mercy and begs for clemency for her beloved Linlin, forcing the troupe to leave Elbaph for good. But the kindness Mother shows belies a dark and twisted secret…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741839.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e19", "season" => 2018, "number" => 19, "name" => "The Launcher Blasts! The Moment of Big Mom's Assassination!", "airdate" => "27 May 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Linlin, destroyed at the disappearance of Mother, falls in with a new cohort and finds a reason to go on living, proving herself a mighty force to be reckoned with! The Straw Hats' plan goes awry and all hope looks to be lost!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741840.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e20", "season" => 2018, "number" => 20, "name" => "The Evil Army! Transform! Germa 66!", "airdate" => "3 Jun 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Bege and the Straw Hats are on the defensive as the full force of Mom`s troops are brought down on them! As they retreat into a fortress, Germa 66 springs in to action! However, Bege has bad news for his allied forces.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741841.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e21", "season" => 2018, "number" => 21, "name" => "Cutting the Father-Son Relationship! Sanji and Judge!", "airdate" => "10 Jun 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "The Straw Hats and Germa 66 are cornered in Bege`s stronghold - with the full force of the Big Mom Pirates pinning them down, it`s only a matter of time before their defenses crack. The only way out seems to be to make a break for it.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741842.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e22", "season" => 2018, "number" => 22, "name" => "Escape From the Tea Party! Luffy vs. Big Mom!", "airdate" => "17 Jun 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The plan is executed to sneak the Straw Hats out of Big Mom`s castle while hidden inside Bege! But the irascible Luffy can`t resist getting in at least one punch against his foe! Meanwhile the Tamate Box slips into the hands of some surprising agent!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741843.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e23", "season" => 2018, "number" => 23, "name" => "The Execution Begins! Luffy's Allied Forces Are Annihilated?!", "airdate" => "24 Jun 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The full might of the Big Mom Pirates proves too much for the Straw Hats and Germa 66. With no other options, they decide to turn and fight, even though it means their total annihilation! But the mysterious Tamate Box comes in to play and shakes up the playin…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741844.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e24", "season" => 2018, "number" => 24, "name" => "The Chateau Collapses! The Straw Hat's Great Escape Begins!", "airdate" => "1 Jul 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "The Whole Cake Chateau starts crumbling while everyone is trying to escape for their lives! Luffy and the others get away and move on to the next stage of their escape which involves some parting of ways. Meanwhile, Big Mom's children notice their mother's ch…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741845.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e25", "season" => 2018, "number" => 25, "name" => "The Spear of Elbaph! Onslaught! The Flying Big Mom!", "airdate" => "8 Jul 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "The Straw Hats continue their mad dash to the Sunny! As Big Mom rages, her underlings decide to turn her Hunger Pang attacks against the Straw Hats! The Whole Cake Island scrambles to remake the cake to calm down Big Mom!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741846.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e26", "season" => 2018, "number" => 26, "name" => "Pudding's Determination - Ablaze! The Seducing Woods", "airdate" => "15 Jul 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Kingbaum puts his life on the line ferrying the Straw Hats towards the Seducing Woods! But Big Mom`s word trumps him in this terrifying forest, and soon enough she catches up! Meanwhile, Pudding puts her plan to rebuild the cake into action - and reveals her…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741847.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e27", "season" => 2018, "number" => 27, "name" => "A Lightning Counterattack! Nami and Zeus the Thundercloud!", "airdate" => "22 Jul 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Zeus pursues the Straw Hats as Nami keeps him occupied. She has a shocking surprise in store for him, however, that might stop Big Mom in her tracks! Meanwhile, Brook and Chopper find the Shark Submerge in a strange situation.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741848.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e28", "season" => 2018, "number" => 28, "name" => "A Coincidental Reunion - Sanji and the Lovestruck Evil Pudding", "airdate" => "29 Jul 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Big Mom is relentless in her pursuit of the Straw Hats! Even being buried alive doesn`t stop her! The plan to recreate the cake to stop her onslaught progresses and Pudding's changeable heart confuses all those looking on!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741950.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e29", "season" => 2018, "number" => 29, "name" => "Save the Sunny! Fighting Bravely! Chopper and Brook!", "airdate" => "5 Aug 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Mama`s onslaught continues as Pudding keeps battling the contradictory urges in her head - to kill or kiss Sanji! Meanwhile, Brook and Chopper are at Perospero`s mercy - and are being reduced to sweetened versions of themselves!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741951.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e30", "season" => 2018, "number" => 30, "name" => "Before the Dawn! Pedro, the Captain of the Guardians!", "airdate" => "12 Aug 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Sandwiched between Big Mom and her advancing fleet, the only hope is the Sunny`s Coup-de-Burst! But can the Straw Hats prepare it in time? Meanwhile, Pedro comes face to face with his past, and embraces a dramatic end to be sure that the tides of time continu…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741952.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e31", "season" => 2018, "number" => 31, "name" => "I'll Be Back! Luffy, Deadly Departure!", "airdate" => "19 Aug 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "The last chance the Straw Hats have is the Coup de Burst! Pedro has made the ultimate sacrifice to give them this one chance to escape, but Big Mom`s naval forces are closing in and poised to knock them out! Luffy has to put himself on the line again to save…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741953.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e32", "season" => 2018, "number" => 32, "name" => "The Man with a Bounty of Billion! The Strongest Sweet General, Katakuri!", "airdate" => "26 Aug 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Nami and the others who escaped the Whole Cake Island by Pedro's sacrifice mourn over his death. Jimbei, however, keeps his calm which makes Brook lose his temper. Meanwhile, Luffy confronts the formidable Sweet General Katakuri in the Mirroworld.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741954.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e33", "season" => 2018, "number" => 33, "name" => "A Hard Battle Starts! Luffy vs. Katakuri!", "airdate" => "2 Sep 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Pudding and Sanji arrive at Cacao Island and begin to remake the only cake that will calm Big Mom! But their fake nuptials get in the way as they bicker like a married couple! Meanwhile, Luffy has lost the battle of his life - and the flame goes out of him...…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741955.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e34", "season" => 2018, "number" => 34, "name" => "The Green Room! An Invincible Helmsman, Jimbei!", "airdate" => "16 Sep 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Luffy keeps the forces out to destroy the Straw Hats at bay, however the crew needs to destroy all the mirrors - the final link that secure his safe return - on the ship in order to save themselves! At the same time, the ship is on a course for disaster, with…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741956.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e35", "season" => 2018, "number" => 35, "name" => "The Threat of the Mole! Luffy's Silent Fight!", "airdate" => "23 Sep 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Nami and the others start breaking all the mirrors on the Sunny in order to keep their enemies out while she and Luffy discuss where to rendezvous – but little do they know the plan is overheard! Meanwhile, Luffy's grueling battle against Katakuri intensifies!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/168/421742.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e36", "season" => 2018, "number" => 36, "name" => "The End of the Deadly Battle?! Katakuri's Awakening in Anger!", "airdate" => "30 Sep 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Both powerful combatants and strong users of Haki, Luffy and Katakuri are a dead match for each other. Every move is matched by their opponent! Elsewhere, the Big Mom Pirates square off against Germa! With so much at stake, Luffy falls to Katakuri, spelling h…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/169/423815.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e37", "season" => 2018, "number" => 37, "name" => "The Forbidden Secret! Katakuri's Merienda!", "airdate" => "7 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Katakuri retires to his sanctuary to enjoy the merienda - a chance for him to savor the sweetness of his crew of chefs and replenish his Haki! But he`s not the only one who`s doing eating, as Straw Hat uses his mouth to get out from under the mochi mountain c…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/170/425937.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e38", "season" => 2018, "number" => 38, "name" => "Luffy Fights Back! The Invincible Katakuri's Weak Point!", "airdate" => "14 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Luffy discovers the secret to Katakuri`s unearthly fighting ability, and just might have a solution for how to stop him! Meanwhile at the Sweets Factory, Pudding receives a call from Brulee who has bad news for the Straw Hats!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/171/429034.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e39", "season" => 2018, "number" => 39, "name" => "Another Crisis! Gear 4 vs Unstoppable Donuts", "airdate" => "21 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Luffy runs out of his Haki and has to buy some time - in the most peculiar way! Meanwhile the Big Mom Pirates mobilize their entire fleet to squelch the pirate threat, and the replacement cake nears completion!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/172/430955.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e40", "season" => 2018, "number" => 40, "name" => "The Rebellious Daughter, Chiffon! Sanji's Big Plan for Transporting the Cake!", "airdate" => "28 Oct 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "When Chiffon comes under attack, Sanji must choose between defending her or revealing himself to his enemies! Meanwhile, Luffy uses Brulee as a human shield to avoid the wrath of Big Mom!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741957.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e41", "season" => 2018, "number" => 41, "name" => "A Man's Way of Life - Bege and Luffy's Determination as Captains", "airdate" => "4 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Bege arrives on the scene, seemingly willing to risk it all to bring down the Big Mom Pirates in a blaze of glory, but of course he has a trick up his sleeve! Meanwhile Luffy keeps on the move to regain his Haki, but begins to ponder just how far his limits c…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741958.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e42", "season" => 2018, "number" => 42, "name" => "The Cake Sank?! Sanji and Bege's Getaway Battle!", "airdate" => "11 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Sanji and Bege get together and get off of Cacao Island successfully but their plan is in jeopardy as Oven begins to boil the sea itself! As Chiffon and the others who are on the ship are cornered, a surprising savior comes in to fight Oven!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741960.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e43", "season" => 2018, "number" => 43, "name" => "Sulong! Carrot's Big Mystic Transformation!", "airdate" => "18 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "A vicious pincer attack bears down on the Straw Hats! Three fleets converge and try to squeeze the life from them! Daifuku himself take the lead! But Carrot draws on a deep power within and springs in to action under the light of the moon!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741961.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e44", "season" => 2018, "number" => 44, "name" => "Break Through! The Straw Hat's Mighty Sea Battle!", "airdate" => "25 Nov 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The much anticipated wedding cake is on its way, but there is a debate at the last minute! Shouldn`t this opportunity be used to slip poison into Big Mom`s meal to topple the Emperor of the Sea? Meanwhile, Carrot`s unearthly ability based on the power of the…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741962.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e45", "season" => 2018, "number" => 45, "name" => "Finally, The Clash! The Emperor of the Sea vs. the Straw Hats!", "airdate" => "9 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Luffy, through sheer force of will, can almost use his Haki to battle Katakuri! Meanwhile, the Sunny catches fire while the Straw Hats try to kick out Big Mom but that's when Jimbei steps up to the plate and takes a swing at her!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741964.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e46", "season" => 2018, "number" => 46, "name" => "Dark King's Direct Precepts! The Battle Against Katakuri Turns Around!", "airdate" => "16 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Luffy tries to enhance his Haki to foresee Katakuri's next move but Katakuri's attacks keep pulling him down! However, when he summons every bit of wisdom from his training with Rayleigh, he remembers something important that could turn the tables for him!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741965.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2018e47", "season" => 2018, "number" => 47, "name" => "He Finally Returns - Sanji, the Man Who Stops the Yonko", "airdate" => "23 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "The cake is finally prepared and brought before Big Mom! With the end of her vicious rampage in sight, there is a chance for the Straw Hats to flee! Big Mom`s crew is forced to decide who to attack! Meanwhile, Luffy grows ever closer to using his Haki!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741967.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2019, "name" => "#867 - #915", "rating" => 8.7, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2019e1", "season" => 2019, "number" => 1, "name" => "Lurking in the Darkness! An Assassin Targeting Luffy!", "airdate" => "6 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Hiding her presence, Flampe shoots her blowgun at Luffy to support her dear brother Katakuri. Meanwhile, Oven launches a dastardly plan to fence Luffy in - by destroying every mirror on the island! And Smoothie is on the tail of the Sunny as it makes its way…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741968.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e2", "season" => 2019, "number" => 2, "name" => "A Man's Resolution - Katakuri's Life Risking Great Match", "airdate" => "13 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Katakuri notices his sister Flampe is sneakily providing poison needle back up in the shadows. Becoming enraged, he takes unexpected action that surprises everyone. Meanwhile, Smoothie increases her size and closes in on the Sunny.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741969.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e3", "season" => 2019, "number" => 3, "name" => "Wake Up - To Cross Over the Strongest Kenbunshoku", "airdate" => "20 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Luffy leans on his training to bring out the power of his Haki! Meanwhile the children of Big Mom gather as a massive force ready to smash Luffy and the Straw Hats. Their resentment at being embarrassed fuels their desire to get revenge!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741970.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e4", "season" => 2019, "number" => 4, "name" => "A Fist of Divine Speed! Another Gear Four Application Activated!", "airdate" => "27 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Luffy and Katakuri are locked in a duel to end all duels! Their powers ensure that each blow could be the last! Luffy must rely on his training, let all his thoughts out, and keep pushing on! Meanwhile, Sanji is about to land at Cacao Island!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741971.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e5", "season" => 2019, "number" => 5, "name" => "Finally, It's Over! The Climax of the Intense Fight against Katakuri!", "airdate" => "3 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Luffy`s dramatic battle finally draws to a close! But even if he is able to pull out victory in the last moment, can he remember the key to escaping the Mirrorworld?! Meanwhile, the whole host of the Big Mom Pirates watch the lonely mirror to see who will com…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741972.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e6", "season" => 2019, "number" => 6, "name" => "A Desperate Situation - The Iron-Tight Entrapment of Luffy!", "airdate" => "10 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Luffy emerges safely! And Pekoms` bravery ensures he and the Straw Hats have a fighting chance! But can they withstand the full force of the Big Mom Pirates? At the last moment - a surprise explodes onto the scene!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741973.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e7", "season" => 2019, "number" => 7, "name" => "Pulling Back from the Brink! The Formidable Reinforcements - Germa!", "airdate" => "17 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Sanji tries his best to save himself and his captain, Luffy! But the arrival of Germa has complicated matters. Whose side do these powerful superhumans fight on? In the end, sisterly love will see Sanji saved!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741974.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e8", "season" => 2019, "number" => 8, "name" => "The Last Hope! The Sun Pirates Emerge!", "airdate" => "24 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Luffy and Sanji are safe! But the critical moment approaches - the fate of Totto Land rests on the taste of the wedding cake! Will it be sweet release or bitter defeat? Meanwhile, a cunning pincer attack leaves the Straw Hats hopelessly trapped. Only old, rel…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741975.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e9", "season" => 2019, "number" => 9, "name" => "A Captivating Flavor! Sanji's Cake of Happiness!", "airdate" => "3 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "With the help of the Sun Pirates, the Straw Hats see their chance to escape! And the Sun Pirates bid farewell to their former captain. Mama finally tastes the Wedding Cake and the results are positively scrumptious!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741976.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e10", "season" => 2019, "number" => 10, "name" => "The Man of Humanity and Justice! Jimbei, a Desperate Massive Ocean Current", "airdate" => "17 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "The Big Mom Pirates fooled! The Straw Hats have eluded their would-be tormentors with the help of the Sun Pirates! However, as the fleet of the Big Mom Pirates is still coming after them, Jimbei makes a crucial decision to help the Sunny to get away.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741977.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e11", "season" => 2019, "number" => 11, "name" => "The Parting Time! Pudding's Last Wish!", "airdate" => "24 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "At a great cost of energy and life, the Straw Hats make it out of Totto Land. Left behind in their wake are allies and friends, and would-be lovers. As the sea opens before them, what price has been paid for their escape?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741978.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e12", "season" => 2019, "number" => 12, "name" => "The World is Stunned! The Fifth Emperor of the Sea Emerges!", "airdate" => "31 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Luffy`s recent exploits make their way around the world! The reputation of this mighty pirate begins to grow as all eyes look towards the Straw Hats` next move! Also - German 66 leaves an artifact behind which excites the crew!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741979.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e13", "season" => 2019, "number" => 13, "name" => "To the Reverie! The Straw Hats' Sworn Allies Come Together!", "airdate" => "7 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "As the royals make their way to the Reverie, the mighty Navy takes all precautions to make sure they don`t fall prey to kidnappings! At the vanguard is Koby, who glimpses Luffy`s exploits and remembers their shared past. Meanwhile, Luffy is confronted with a…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741980.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e14", "season" => 2019, "number" => 14, "name" => "Sabo Goes into Action! All the Captains of the Revolutionary Army Appear!", "airdate" => "14 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "A vicious pirate group led by Pinkbeard who describes himself as one of Blackbeard's affiliates attacks a town in the Kingdom of Lulucia while their king and able-bodied soldiers have gone to the Reverie. And four bizarre individuals come to help. They're the…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741981.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e15", "season" => 2019, "number" => 15, "name" => "Going into Action! The Implacable New Admiral of the Fleet - Sakazuki!", "airdate" => "21 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.2, "summary" => "At New Marineford, Sakazuki, the new Admiral of the Fleet, hears the news about Luffy and recalls the tumultuous Paramount War that haunts the Navy! That game-changing war has repercussions that last into the present!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741982.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e16", "season" => 2019, "number" => 16, "name" => "The Summit War - Pirate King's Inherited Will", "airdate" => "28 Apr 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "Nobles from around the world gather for the Reverie as the echoes of the Paramount War resound! Among them are Shirahoshi and her family from the Ryugu Kingdom under the sea. Meanwhile, Admiral Fujitora has a conversation with his new colleague, Admiral Ryoku…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741983.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e17", "season" => 2019, "number" => 17, "name" => "One Step Ahead of the Dream - Shirahoshi's Path to the Sun!", "airdate" => "5 May 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "Stelly, Sabo's adopted brother and now the king of the Goa Kingdom, walks up to Garp who is escorting the royal family of the Fish-Man Island, with an air of importance and something up his sleeve. Meanwhile, Shirahoshi sees the surface world for the first ti…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741984.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e18", "season" => 2019, "number" => 18, "name" => "I Miss Him! Vivi and Rebecca's Sentiments!", "airdate" => "12 May 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.2, "summary" => "Shirahoshi and her family finally reach the Holyland of Mariejois! But all the unexpected attention confuses her. Meanwhile, Vivi from Alabasta meets Leo and Rebecca from Dressrosa, and tells them the story of her journey with the Straw Hats.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741985.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e19", "season" => 2019, "number" => 19, "name" => "In the Dark Recesses of the Holyland! A Mysterious Giant Straw Hat!", "airdate" => "19 May 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Vivi reunites with Dalton and Dr. Kureha from the Sakura Kingdom and they share their memories of the Straw Hats with Shirahoshi and Rebecca. Meanwhile, a shadowy figure descends a long staircase at the castle in the Holyland and opens a mysterious door.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741986.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e20", "season" => 2019, "number" => 20, "name" => "The Holyland in Tumult! The Targeted Princess Shirahoshi!", "airdate" => "26 May 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.2, "summary" => "Shirahoshi crosses the fancy of a Celestial Dragon, and those living gods are not open to having their whims disobeyed! As she is dragged away, King Neptune comes to her rescue, risking life and limb by defying the Celestial Dragon, but luckily an old friend…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741987.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e21", "season" => 2019, "number" => 21, "name" => "An Explosive Situation! Two Emperors of the Sea Going After Luffy!", "airdate" => "2 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "The Emperors of the Sea, Big Mom and Kaido decide to team up against Luffy! Meanwhile, Garp hears about the wild exploits of his grandson, all while a mysterious outsider visits the highest authority in the world!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741989.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e22", "season" => 2019, "number" => 22, "name" => "Sabo Enraged! The Tragedy of the Revolutionary Army Officer Kuma!", "airdate" => "9 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "After sneaking into the Land of the Gods, Sabo sees the shocking figure of his friend – Kuma! Abused by the World Government as a pawn in their games, Kuma, who was made an example of what happens when you disobey the gods!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741990.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e23", "season" => 2019, "number" => 23, "name" => "Finally, It Starts! The Conspiracy-filled Reverie!", "airdate" => "16 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The Reverie has begun! The representative kings and queens first discuss what to do with Straw Hat Luffy. Meanwhile the Revolutionary Army confirms its desire to save Kuma! All while they recount how the Straw Hats have grown from upstarts into world players!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/290/727184.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e24", "season" => 2019, "number" => 24, "name" => "Marco! The Keeper of Whitebeard's Last Memento!", "airdate" => "23 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "Nekomamushi and the Guardians reach Whitebeard's home island. Nekomamushi finds Marco in a hidden village where he works as a doctor. During the meeting, Marco tells Nekomamushi about Whitebeard's childhood and the reason he cannot leave the island.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/290/727186.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e25", "season" => 2019, "number" => 25, "name" => "Climbing Up a Waterfall! A Great Journey Through the Land of Wano's Sea Zone!", "airdate" => "30 Jun 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Luffy and the others become excited as they see familiar faces in a newspaper article about the Reverie while they close in on the Land of Wano. But this dangerous and foreboding land is as inaccessible as it is mysterious! The sea itself is a barrier!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741994.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e26", "season" => 2019, "number" => 26, "name" => "The Land of Wano! To the Samurai Country where Cherry Blossoms Flutter!", "airdate" => "7 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "A mysterious country, a rampaging slasher, ancient samurai rituals of seppuku - and Zoro in the crosshairs! When a street assault occurs, all signs point to Zoro! Meanwhile, Luffy finally arrives at the Land of Wano but all his friends are nowhere to be found.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741995.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e27", "season" => 2019, "number" => 27, "name" => "Otama Appears! Luffy vs. Kaido's Army!", "airdate" => "14 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Stranded alone on the beach, Luffy tries to gather his bearings only to be confronted by some mysterious, and dangerous, local fauna! And then, he meets a little girl named Otama! Meanwhile, Zoro makes trouble for the others who are trying to blend in!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741996.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e28", "season" => 2019, "number" => 28, "name" => "He'll Come! The Legend of Ace in the Land of Wano!", "airdate" => "21 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Otama`s gratitude towards Luffy knows no bounds! But the feast she cooks him exhausts her food stores completely! As she suffers from poor drinking water, her companion tells the story of the mysterious outsider she waits for - Ace!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741997.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e29", "season" => 2019, "number" => 29, "name" => "Side Story! The World's Greatest Bounty Hunter, Cidre!", "airdate" => "28 Jul 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Ambushed and outgunned by a skilled bounty hunter Cidre's group, the Straw Hats rely on the Sunny`s Coup de Burst to escape! But they end up stranded without cola! A nearby soda island offers a solution - but Luffy is quickly in over his head! Luckily a vivac…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741998.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e30", "season" => 2019, "number" => 30, "name" => "Side Story! Clash! Luffy vs. the King of Carbonation!", "airdate" => "4 Aug 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Luffy and Boa Hancock square off against the Cidre Guild! These unscrupulous bounty hunters have one thing in mind - profit at any cost! When the battle looks won, Cidre gears up in a menacing power suit!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/741999.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e31", "season" => 2019, "number" => 31, "name" => "Save Otama! Straw Hat, Bounding through the Wasteland!", "airdate" => "11 Aug 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Otama recounts her promise to Ace while Luffy rushes her to medical attention. But just as they reach the wasteland, a familiar face comes into view! But Kaido`s underlings show up too!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742000.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e32", "season" => 2019, "number" => 32, "name" => "The Headliner! Hawkings the Magician Appears!", "airdate" => "18 Aug 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Otama's temperature is going up and Luffy has no time to waste! However, Hawkins, one of Kaido's Headliners, blocks their way by showing his unique powers and skills which can harm his own men.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742001.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e33", "season" => 2019, "number" => 33, "name" => "Defeat is Inevitable! The Strawman's Fierce Attack!", "airdate" => "25 Aug 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Luffy and Zoro have been stalled by Hawkins but their fortune looks bright as they are guided by a woman who Zoro had saved. She leads them to a teahouse and to an herbal remedy for the river poison. All the while, old acquaintances look on from a distance!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742002.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e34", "season" => 2019, "number" => 34, "name" => "The Greatest Day of My Life! Otama and Her Sweet Red-bean Soup!", "airdate" => "1 Sep 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Otama`s life is saved by Otsuru at her teahouse. The proud Otama finds it hard to take more kindness. The group learns of the Okobore Town - living on the cast-offs of the officials! Then, suddenly, they were attacked by the Shogun's men!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742003.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e35", "season" => 2019, "number" => 35, "name" => "Charging into the Enemy's Territory! Bakura Town - Where Officials Thrive!", "airdate" => "8 Sep 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Otama has been kidnapped by the Gifters! She is taken to a flourishing town called Bakura Town where a creepy-looking Headliner was expecting her. Luffy and Zoro rush to rescue her along with a samurai, Okiku!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742004.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e36", "season" => 2019, "number" => 36, "name" => "The Yokozuna Appears! The Invincible Urashima Goes After Okiku!", "airdate" => "15 Sep 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "As Luffy, Zoro, and Okiku bounce through Bakura Town on Komachiyo's back, looking for the kidnapped Otama, a sumo wrestler comes flying towards them! Interested, they go down to watch sumo but the undefeated yokozuna Urashima has been expecting Okiku there an…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742005.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e37", "season" => 2019, "number" => 37, "name" => "A Climatic Sumo Battle! Straw Hat vs. the Strongest Ever Yokozuna!", "airdate" => "22 Sep 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "Luffy challenges Urashima, the strongest yokozuna in the Land of Wano, to a sumo match! Urashima even uses illegal moves to beat Luffy at any cost! Meanwhile, Holdem tells Otama that he knows she committed a crime and he has to punish her for it.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742006.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e38", "season" => 2019, "number" => 38, "name" => "Luffy Rages! Rescue Otama from Danger!", "airdate" => "29 Sep 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "After sending the yokozuna Urashima flying, Luffy and his clan continue their search for Bakura Town's boss to save Otama! They finally find the boss, Holdem, one of the Beast Pirates' Headliners, and Otama who is hanging in the mouth of a lion in Holdem's st…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742007.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e39", "season" => 2019, "number" => 39, "name" => "Taking Back Otama! A Fierce Fight Against Holdem!", "airdate" => "6 Oct 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Facing Holdem who is holding Otama as hostage, Luffy prepares for a fight but Okiku tries to stop him by sharing who is really ruling the region. Meanwhile, Basil Hawkins who is also working for Kaido and chasing after Luffy, is confronted by a mysterious fig…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742008.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e40", "season" => 2019, "number" => 40, "name" => "Duel! The Magician and the Surgeon of Death!", "airdate" => "13 Oct 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Taking down Holdem, Luffy rescues Otama and tries to catch up to Zoro and Okiku who stole the food treasure ship and started a mad dash to get out of the town! Meanwhile, Trafalgar Law's attempt to silence Basil Hawkins fails when he hears bad news about his…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742009.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e41", "season" => 2019, "number" => 41, "name" => "Romance Dawn", "airdate" => "20 Oct 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "This is a story of Luffy in an alternate reality. While sailing on the sea by himself, a strange bird crashes into his small boat. He looks up to find a giant ship where a girl named Ann has been captured. It seems like the bird belongs to her.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742010.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e42", "season" => 2019, "number" => 42, "name" => "The Coming of the Treasure Ship! Luffytaro Returns the Favor!", "airdate" => "27 Oct 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Zoro and the others dash out of BakuraTown on the treasure ship filled with food! Luffy catches up to them bringing ahuge bucket of fresh water! Then, they distribute the food and the water to thepeople of Okobore Town who were thirsty and hungry.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742011.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e43", "season" => 2019, "number" => 43, "name" => "Mysterious Grave Markers! A Reunion at the Ruins of Oden Castle!", "airdate" => "10 Nov 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Luffy arrives at the ruins of Oden Castle following Law and finds the graves of his friends, Kin'emon and the others. As Law starts telling the already-stunned Luffy about the creepy story of Kin'emon's ghost, Luffy sees it coming towards him!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742012.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e44", "season" => 2019, "number" => 44, "name" => "A Legendary Samurai! The Man Who Roger Admired!", "airdate" => "17 Nov 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Kin'emon tells Luffy and the others about how Kozuki Oden made Kuri into a peaceful region and became its Daimyo. However, he was set up by Kaido and Kurozumi Orochi and executed. Kin'emon and his fellow vassals ran to Oden Castle in flames to save Oden's wif…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742015.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e45", "season" => 2019, "number" => 45, "name" => "Bringing Down the Emperor of the Sea! A Secret Raid Operation Begins!", "airdate" => "24 Nov 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Kin'emon and the others crossed through time by the power of Kozuki Toki, Momonosuke's mother, and arrived at the Land of Wano 20 years later, a totally different country before their eyes. However, discovering that there were still their allies there, they s…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742016.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e46", "season" => 2019, "number" => 46, "name" => "The Strongest Man in the World! Shutenmaru, the Thieves Brigade Chief!", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Ashura Doji, one of the allies Kin'emon wants to search for, has become the head of a thieves brigade and they now raid Okobore Town taking away the food that Luffy gave to the people. Ashura Doji, under the name Shutenmaru, then faces Kaido's right-hand man…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742017.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e47", "season" => 2019, "number" => 47, "name" => "Everyone is Annihilated! Kaido's Furious Blast Breath!", "airdate" => "8 Dec 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "The drunken Kaido flies above Okobore Town in his dragon form and threatens Shutenmaru and all the people in the town. Luffy, Law, Kin'emon, and Okiku start running towards the town to rescue them. However, Kaido heads towards the ruins of Oden Castle where t…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742018.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e48", "season" => 2019, "number" => 48, "name" => "Finally Clashing! The Ferocious Luffy vs. Kaido!", "airdate" => "15 Dec 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "After Luffy sees Kaido shattering the ruins of Oden Castle where he left his friends, he becomes enraged and attacks Kaido! Soon after, he finds out Kaido even assaulted Otama who was riding on Speed's back to her home. Furious, Luffy reveals himself to Kaido…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742019.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2019e49", "season" => 2019, "number" => 49, "name" => "Destructive! One Shot, One Kill - Thunder Bagua!", "airdate" => "22 Dec 2019", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "An infuriated Luffy strikes blow after blow on the drunken Kaido. When he activates Gear Four Bounce-Man and launches even more powerful attacks, Kaido fights back and knocks him out with just one blow. Law tries to rescue Luffy but is interrupted by Hawkins…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742021.jpg"),
