        array("id" => "s2020e16", "season" => 2020, "number" => 16, "name" => "Climb Up! Luffy's Desperate Escape!", "airdate" => "5 Jul 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Luffy and Old Man Hyo try to climb up the wall and break out of the Excavation Labor Camp, but Queen the Plague stands in their way and gives them a hard time! Meanwhile, Nami and Robin experience a public bathhouse along with Shinobu and come to know about t…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742034.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e17", "season" => 2020, "number" => 17, "name" => "Dead or Alive! Queen's Sumo Inferno!", "airdate" => "12 Jul 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Luffy fights quite a few Queen's men at once in the deadly sumo match while protecting Old Man Hyo! Meanwhile, Nami, Robin, and Shinobu are cornered as Hawkins comes to raid the bathhouse. However, someone who they don't expect to be there pops up from nowher…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742035.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e18", "season" => 2020, "number" => 18, "name" => "Gyukimaru! Zoro Fights a Duel on Bandit's Bridge", "airdate" => "19 Jul 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Luffy deals with the endless supply of opponents trying to figure out the way to use Haki that Rayleigh taught him a while ago. Meanwhile, Zoro faces Gyukimaru who is accusing him of stealing Shusui, however, their duel is interrupted by a woman's scream.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742036.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e19", "season" => 2020, "number" => 19, "name" => "A Big Turnover! The Three-Sword Style Overcomes Danger!", "airdate" => "26 Jul 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The duel between Zoro and Gyukimaru is interrupted by Kamazo, Orochi's assassin who came after a little girl Toko. Without Shusui, Zoro has a hard time fighting the two at the same time, but he finds an unlikely third sword to take down the enemies.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742037.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e20", "season" => 2020, "number" => 20, "name" => "Zoro, Stunned! The Shocking Identity of the Mysterious Woman!", "airdate" => "2 Aug 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Luffy's next enemies in the deadly sumo match in the Excavation Labor Camp are two tough Gifters. Much to Old Man Hyo's surprise, Luffy keeps practicing using Haki properly at the same time as he fights them. Meanwhile, the wounded Zoro wakes up to find out t…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742038.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e21", "season" => 2020, "number" => 21, "name" => "Get the Hang of It! The Land of Wano's Haki - Ryuo!", "airdate" => "9 Aug 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Hiyori tells Zoro a stunning story of escaping the incident 20 years ago and surviving until the present day. Meanwhile, Luffy stills struggles to master the Haki of the Color of Arms, but a surprising person steps up and gives an example.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742039.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e22", "season" => 2020, "number" => 22, "name" => "Tonoyasu! Ebisu Town's Most Loved!", "airdate" => "16 Aug 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Luffy continues training himself to use Haki with Old Man Hyo's help, but the battle is suddenly suspended and shortly thereafter Raizo appears in front of them. Meanwhile, Nami, Usopp, and the others are wondering who Tonoyasu, Ebisu Town's hero, really is.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742040.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e23", "season" => 2020, "number" => 23, "name" => "Shaking the Nation! The Identity of Ushimitsu Kozo The Chivalrous Thief!", "airdate" => "23 Aug 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Ushimitsu Kozo the great thief who robbed from the rich and gave to the poor gets caught and his true identity stuns Orochi and the others. When Toko hears the news, she gets very upset and so is Zoro when he hears the reason.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742041.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e24", "season" => 2020, "number" => 24, "name" => "The Straw Hats Run! Save the Captive Tonoyasu!", "airdate" => "30 Aug 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Tonoyasu has been strung up and is soon-to-be executed. The people of the Land of Wano recognize who he really is and start raising their voice while the Straw Hats rush to save him. Then, Tonoyasu starts addressing the nation and the corrupt Shogun Orochi.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742042.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e25", "season" => 2020, "number" => 25, "name" => "Zoro's Fury! The Truth About the Smile!", "airdate" => "6 Sep 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "By the time Kin'emon and the others notice that Yasuie is trying to sacrifice his life to save their raid plan, it was all too late. Ebisu Town`s people laughing out loud annoys Zoro, but when Hiyori tells him the reason behind it, he is in for a shock!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742043.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e26", "season" => 2020, "number" => 26, "name" => "Toko's Tears! Orochi's Pitiless Bullets!", "airdate" => "13 Sep 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Hiyori and Shinobu tearfully tell the Straw Hats the truth behind Ebisu Town residents` cheerfulness and smiles, which infuriates them. When Yasuie's daughter, Toko, runs to her father's body, Orochi recognizes who she is and takes a shot at her!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742045.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e27", "season" => 2020, "number" => 27, "name" => "The Straw Hats Step In! An Uproarious Deadly Battle at the Execution Ground!", "airdate" => "20 Sep 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Zoro and Sanji start fighting against Orochi's clan. Nami and the rest of the Straw Hats join them. Meanwhile, at the Excavation Labor Camp, a new criminal, Hitokiri Kamazo, has arrived. And someone else who is brought to the site reveals the shocking truth a…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742048.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e28", "season" => 2020, "number" => 28, "name" => "Luffy's Determination! Win Through the Sumo Inferno!", "airdate" => "27 Sep 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Zoro keeps fighting Kyoshiro, but Orochi's Oniwabanshu comes to back Kyoshiro up. Meanwhile, at the Excavation Labor Camp, Queen announces the restart of the Sumo Inferno with a new cruel rule which is painful not only to Luffy, but also to Drake and Killer.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742050.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e29", "season" => 2020, "number" => 29, "name" => "The Storm Has Come! A Raging Big Mom!", "airdate" => "4 Oct 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Kin'emon apologizes Ashura Doji AKA Shutenmaru for goading Holdem to attack Atamayama where Ashura's hideout was located, and asks him to join the fight against Kaido. Meanwhile, Chopper and his group finally arrived at the Excavation Labor Camp and Big Mom f…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742051.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e30", "season" => 2020, "number" => 30, "name" => "A Grudge Over Red-bean Soup! Luffy Gets into a Desperate Situation!", "airdate" => "11 Oct 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Craving red-bean soup, Big Mom attacks Queen, the Animal Kingdom Pirates' Lead Performer who reins over Udon. However, when she finds out that the pot is empty, she turns her wrath against the one who ate it all: Luffy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742052.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e31", "season" => 2020, "number" => 31, "name" => "Stop the Emperor of the Sea! Queen's Secret Plan!", "airdate" => "18 Oct 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "After finding out that Luffy ate the whole pot ofthe red-bean soup that she was looking for, Big Mom becomes infuriated and goesafter him. Meanwhile, Queen, the Lead Performer, comes up with a plan to stopthe rampaging Big Mom.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742053.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e32", "season" => 2020, "number" => 32, "name" => "Brutal Ammunition! The Plague Rounds Aim at Luffy!", "airdate" => "25 Oct 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "Queen hastily ties up the sleeping Big Mom and carries her to Onigashima leaving Udon to Babanuki. Babanuki uses a weapon that Queen made to threaten inmates and make them catch Luffy, but a mysterious figure emerges from the forbidden cell to save Luffy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742054.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e33", "season" => 2020, "number" => 33, "name" => "Start Fighting Back! Luffy and the Akazaya Samurai!", "airdate" => "1 Nov 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Kawamatsu the Kappa is freed and stands up against Babanuki and his underlings! Listening to Old Man Hyo's suggestion, Raizo and Kiku reveal their true identities which give the desperate prisoners not only a shock but also some hope.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742055.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e34", "season" => 2020, "number" => 34, "name" => "We're Here to Win! Luffy's Desperate Scream", "airdate" => "8 Nov 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Luffy faces those who are infected by the Plague Rounds and the non-infected prisoners who submit to the authority of Udon. To open their eyes, Luffy takes a measure that will risk his life. However, the Chief Warden Babanuki has something up his sleeve.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742056.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e35", "season" => 2020, "number" => 35, "name" => "Warriors' Dream! Luffy's Conquer of Udon!", "airdate" => "15 Nov 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "The freed prisoners in Udon refuse to fight alongside Luffy because he is a pirate. Raizo and Old Man Hyo try their best to convince them, but an unexpected person stands up to bring the prisoners hope after taking down Kaido!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742057.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e36", "season" => 2020, "number" => 36, "name" => "Orochi's Hunting Party! The Ninja Group vs. Zoro!", "airdate" => "22 Nov 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "After standing against Orochi, Zoro and Hiyori are chased by Orochi's ninja group. Meanwhile, Orochi is told that they captured Trafalgar Law as the people of the Flower Capital prepare for the upcoming Fire Festival.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742058.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e37", "season" => 2020, "number" => 37, "name" => "Tension Rises in Onigashima! Two Emperors of the Sea Meet?!", "airdate" => "29 Nov 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Nami and Franky join Kanjuro who has taken Yasuie's dead body to bury him with Oden, and together they hit the road. Robin, Usopp, and Brook are at the dock trying to figure out a way to pass through a check point. Meanwhile, Big Mom and Kaido finally clash a…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742059.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e38", "season" => 2020, "number" => 38, "name" => "Hiyori's Confession! A Reunion at Bandit's Bridge!", "airdate" => "6 Dec 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "As the clash between Kaido and Big Mom continues, Queen looks for a way to get out of Onigashima. Meanwhile in Udon, Old Man Hyo finds his former allies, four bosses from each region. At Bandit's Bridge, Hiyori and Kawamatsu finally see each other after a lon…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/290/727180.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e39", "season" => 2020, "number" => 39, "name" => "Its Name is Enma! Oden's Great Swords!", "airdate" => "13 Dec 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Zoro runs after the warrior-monk who took his Shusui and Kawamatsu shares with Hiyori his memory of a fox that was guarding the graves in Ringo. As they catch up to Zoro, they find a room filled with swords. And Hiyori tells Zoro to give Shusui back to the La…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742060.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e40", "season" => 2020, "number" => 40, "name" => "A New Alliance?! Kaido's Army Gathers!", "airdate" => "20 Dec 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "As the day of the raid approaches, Law finds someone who might help him escape the prison and Kin'emon gathers up most of his main allies to discuss the raid plan. Meanwhile, at Onigashima, Kaido and Big Mom make a stunning declaration!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/290/727179.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2020e41", "season" => 2020, "number" => 41, "name" => "Ticking Down to the Great Battle! The Straw Hats Go into Combat Mode!", "airdate" => "27 Dec 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Kin'emon, Momonosuke, and the others can't fight back tears when they hear that Hiyori is alive. Zoro is stunned by Enma's demonic power and its ties to him. And as the day of the Fire Festival is finally in sight, Kin'emon and the others head out for the ren…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742061.jpg"),
    )),
