        array("id" => "s2021e5", "season" => 2021, "number" => 5, "name" => "Tearfully Swearing Allegiance! Oden and Kin'emon!", "airdate" => "7 Feb 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "When the angry mountain god, the giant boar, almost kills Kin'emon, Oden steps in. Kin'emon is impressed when he sees Oden's strength and pledges his life to serve him. Disavowed by his father, Oden decides to go on a journey around the country and gathers mo…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742066.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e6", "season" => 2021, "number" => 6, "name" => "Changing Destiny - The Whitebeard Pirates Cast Ashore!", "airdate" => "14 Feb 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Oden transforms the wild land of Kuri into a habitable region and is made Daimyo over it. Then he meets Kawamatsu the Kappa and the two Minks, Dogstorm and Cat Viper, who become his followers like the others. Kin'emon and the other vassals are scolded by Yasu…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/296/742067.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e7", "season" => 2021, "number" => 7, "name" => "Oden's Determination! Whitebeard's Test!", "airdate" => "21 Feb 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Whitebeard and his crew dock at one of the ports in the Land of Wano with their broken ship and the news excites Oden. He runs to the port and asks Whitebeard to let him get on board the ship but the request is rejected. When the ship's repairs are complete,…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047640.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e8", "season" => 2021, "number" => 8, "name" => "Whitebeard's Little Brother! Oden's Great Adventure!", "airdate" => "28 Feb 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "Oden rescues Toki from the slavers and befriends her. She wants to travel to Wano, which unfortunately displeases him. With the appearance of Whitebeard on the coast, the course of their journey changes.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047641.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e9", "season" => 2021, "number" => 9, "name" => "Blades Crossed! Roger and Whitebeard!", "airdate" => "7 Mar 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "While Oden is still traveling the world with Whitebeard, his father's health is increasingly deteriorating. Orochi is to fill in as shogun until Oden's return.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047657.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e10", "season" => 2021, "number" => 10, "name" => "Roger's Wish! A New Journey!", "airdate" => "21 Mar 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "The Roger Pirates against the Whitebeard Pirates! Their battle extends over three days and nights. Which crew will emerge victorious?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047658.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e11", "season" => 2021, "number" => 11, "name" => "Devoting His Life! Roger's Adventure!", "airdate" => "28 Mar 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Roger's joint adventure with Oden continues. They travel to Sky Island, Water 7 and also Fish Man Island in search of the Porneglyph.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047669.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e12", "season" => 2021, "number" => 12, "name" => "The King of the Pirates is Born! Arriving at the Last Island!", "airdate" => "4 Apr 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "After Roger and his crew have inspected all the Road Poneglyphs, they set off for the last island. What awaits them there leaves them speechless.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047714.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e13", "season" => 2021, "number" => 13, "name" => "To the Land of Wano! The Roger Pirates Disband!", "airdate" => "11 Apr 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "After the Roger Pirates have been on Laugh Tale, they decide to disband. Captain Roger is the first man to disembark. After that, his remaining crew takes Oden back to Wano.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047716.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e14", "season" => 2021, "number" => 14, "name" => "Sad News! The Opening of the Great Pirate Era!", "airdate" => "18 Apr 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Oden learns that Orochi is tyrannizing Wano as the new shogun. When he hears that Toki has been injured in an attack on Momonosuke, he rushes to the capital to attack Orochi.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047836.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e15", "season" => 2021, "number" => 15, "name" => "Raid! Oden and the Akazaya Nine", "airdate" => "25 Apr 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Oden keeps dancing naked in the Flower Capital and losing all the trust of the people. His vassals wonder why he is doing this. One day, Orochi comes to Kuri and reveals his evil plan for the Land of Wano.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047838.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e16", "season" => 2021, "number" => 16, "name" => "The End of the Battle! Oden vs. Kaido!", "airdate" => "2 May 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "It comes to the decisive battle between Kaido's army and Oden and his samurais. How will the battle end? What card does Kaido have up his sleeve against Oden?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047841.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e17", "season" => 2021, "number" => 17, "name" => "Boiled to Death! Oden's One-hour Struggle!", "airdate" => "9 May 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Oden proposes a bet to Kaido and Orochi. If he and his vassals manage to survive in the cauldron for a certain amount of time, they must release them. Kaido and Orochi accept his proposal.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047856.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e18", "season" => 2021, "number" => 18, "name" => "Oden Wouldn't Be Oden If It Wasn't Boiled!", "airdate" => "16 May 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Oden and his vassals must endure one hour in the cauldron of boiling oil. If they succeed, they will be free. However, Orochi is already forging the next devious plan.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047857.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e19", "season" => 2021, "number" => 19, "name" => "The Castle on Fire! The Fate of the Kozuki Clan!", "airdate" => "23 May 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "Oden Kozuki was executed but thanks to him his vassals were able to escape. They run to Oden Castle to help Toki and her children who are attacked by Kaido.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047859.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e20", "season" => 2021, "number" => 20, "name" => "Back to the Present Day! 20 Years Later", "airdate" => "30 May 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Momonosuke, Raizo, Kanjuro and Kinemon were sent 20 years into the future by Toki. In the meantime, their remaining comrades wait for them and disguise themselves among the people of Wano.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047868.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e21", "season" => 2021, "number" => 21, "name" => "Pirates at Sea! Raid! Onward to Onigashima", "airdate" => "6 Jun 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Kinemon and the other Akazayas want to cross to Onigashima by boat! However, they are stopped by Kaido's fleet on the way. The spy who revealed their plan finally reveals himself.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047869.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e22", "season" => 2021, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Worst Generation Charges in! The Battle of the Stormy Sea!", "airdate" => "13 Jun 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Luffy, Law and Kid have come to the aid of Kinemon and the Akazayas. Before they can continue sailing towards Onigashima, they have to sink Kaido's battleships.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047877.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e23", "season" => 2021, "number" => 23, "name" => "Good Luck?! Leader Kin'emon's Plot!", "airdate" => "20 Jun 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Kyoshiro has come with his clan for support. But to everyone's surprise, he does not attack the Straw Hats or the Akazayas, but targets Kaido's fleet instead. How will the course of the battle develop?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047885.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e24", "season" => 2021, "number" => 24, "name" => "A Tearful Promise! The Kidnapped Momonosuke!", "airdate" => "27 Jun 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Kanjuro grabbed Momonsuke and is now on his way to Onigashima. Luffy and the others start heading there, but Kaido's army gets in their way again.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047895.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e25", "season" => 2021, "number" => 25, "name" => "A New Member! 'First Son of the Sea' Jimbei!", "airdate" => "4 Jul 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Jimbei has joined the Straw Hat Pirates and arrived in time to raid Onigashima. Now Kinemon is planning the invasion of the island. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047900.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e26", "season" => 2021, "number" => 26, "name" => "Kaido's Trump Card! The Tobi Roppo Appear!", "airdate" => "11 Jul 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "While Luffy, Kinemon and all the other comrades are still on their way to Onigashima there's a big banquet on the island and Queen gives an unforgetable concert.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047912.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e27", "season" => 2021, "number" => 27, "name" => "The Samurai Warriors' Earnestness! The Straw Hats Land at Onigashima", "airdate" => "18 Jul 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "As the alliance reaches Onigashima, Kinemon uses his sorcery to change everyone's clothes to blend in with the Beasts Pirates. He then gives a speech to the samurai to take advantage of their disguises and reach the castle for the final battle. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047914.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e28", "season" => 2021, "number" => 28, "name" => "Luffy Goes Out of Control?! Sneaking into Kaido's Banquet", "airdate" => "25 Jul 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "As Kinemon and Denjiro's forces advance across the mountain paths, Luffy and his men charge through the main entrance. Luffy and Zoro get lost in the hustle and bustle of the banquet and strike up a conversation with Kaido's men.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047916.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e29", "season" => 2021, "number" => 29, "name" => "Thinking of Otama! Luffy's Furious Strike!", "airdate" => "1 Aug 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Luffy and Zoro pick a fight with the Beast Pirates for intentionally wasting food. Luffy's Elephant Gun causes even more chaos.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047919.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e30", "season" => 2021, "number" => 30, "name" => "Fighting Music! An Ability That Harms Luffy!", "airdate" => "8 Aug 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "As the Kid Pirates head towards Kaidou, Luffy and Zoro are attacked by Scratchmen Apoo with his Tone-Tone abilities. Kid gets blinded by revenge and attacks Apoo for betraying him. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047923.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e31", "season" => 2021, "number" => 31, "name" => "His Dream Broken?! The Trap That Lures Sanji!", "airdate" => "15 Aug 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "The Kid Pirates abandon their mission to join the fight against Apoo and the Beast Pirates to allow Luffy, Zoro, Kid and Killer continue searching for Kaido. Due to the commotion of the fight, the compound is emptying out, allowing Kinemon's forces to pass un…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047924.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e32", "season" => 2021, "number" => 32, "name" => "Reinforcements Arrive! The Commander of the Whitebeard Pirates!", "airdate" => "22 Aug 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "The Big Mom Pirates are climbing up the waterfall of Wano again. However, this time it is not King who hinders them, but an unexpected opponent stands in their way.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047939.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e33", "season" => 2021, "number" => 33, "name" => "Oath of Man! Fierce Battle of the Brachio-Tank", "airdate" => "29 Aug 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Big Mom chases the Brachio Tank V driven by Chopper and Usopp. Meanwhile, Kanjuro takes Momonosuke to Kaido and Orochi and informs them about Oden's vassals.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047949.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e34", "season" => 2021, "number" => 34, "name" => "Thunder Bagua! Here Comes Kaido's Son!", "airdate" => "5 Sep 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Luffy runs into two members of the Tobi Roppo: Ulti and Page The brother and sister duo use their Devil Fruit powers and turn themselves into massive beasts. When Luffy is driven into a corner, someone wearing a demon mask appears and whisks him away. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047984.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e35", "season" => 2021, "number" => 35, "name" => "Enemy or Ally? Luffy and Yamato!", "airdate" => "12 Sep 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Luffy is kidnapped by the ominous Yamato, who claims to be Kaido's son. How will their encounter unfold? Meanwhile, Chopper and Usopp are still on the run from Big Mom. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047986.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e36", "season" => 2021, "number" => 36, "name" => "Desire to be Oden! Yamato's Dream!", "airdate" => "19 Sep 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Orochi announces the execution of Momonosuke and Kaido also has an important announcement to make. Meanwhile, Yamato tells Luffy a story. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047987.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e37", "season" => 2021, "number" => 37, "name" => "Explosive?! The Handcuffs that Shackle Yamato's Freedom!", "airdate" => "26 Sep 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "The Akazaya have reached the back entrance of Onigashima and try to get through the gate, but they are stopped by the traitor Kanjuro. Meanwhile, Kaido reveals his grand plan.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047990.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e38", "season" => 2021, "number" => 38, "name" => "The Akazaya Face-off! Kikunojo vs. Kanjuro!", "airdate" => "3 Oct 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "While Kaido and Big Mom proclaim their goal, Kikunojo faces Kanjuro at the back entrance of Onigashima and gets into an emotional fight with her former colleague.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1047991.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e39", "season" => 2021, "number" => 39, "name" => "Raid! Inheriting Oden's Will", "airdate" => "10 Oct 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "The Akazaya charge at Kaido from the back entrance of Onigashima and open the fierce battle.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048156.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e40", "season" => 2021, "number" => 40, "name" => "Onigashima in Tumult! Luffy's All-Out War Begins!", "airdate" => "24 Oct 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "The Akazayas deliver a devastating blow to Kaido. Luffy and Yamato try to support them, but Ulti and Big Mom get in their way. Meanwhile, Nami and Carrot set out to retrieve Zeus.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048157.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e41", "season" => 2021, "number" => 41, "name" => "The Battle Under the Moon! The Berserker, Sulong the Moon Lion!", "airdate" => "31 Oct 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Kaido's men are amazed when they see thousands of samurai warriors storming into the castle. Kaido goes outside to fight the Akazayas in his dragon form. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048158.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e42", "season" => 2021, "number" => 42, "name" => "Zeus' Treason?! The Cornered Nami!", "airdate" => "7 Nov 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Shinobu tries to rescue Momonosuke but is discovered and attacked by King. Meanwhile, Nami is chased by Zeus who is ordered by Big Mom to kill her.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048159.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e43", "season" => 2021, "number" => 43, "name" => "The Fate That Protects You - Yamato and Momonosuke", "airdate" => "14 Nov 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Franky, Robin and Jimbei face Big Mom but the Numbers interrupt their fight. One of them holds the Brachio Tank containing Usopp and Chopper in his hand. Meanwhile, Yamato finally meets Momonosuke.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048166.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e44", "season" => 2021, "number" => 44, "name" => "Overwhelming Strength! The Straw Hats Come Together!", "airdate" => "21 Nov 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Luffy and Zoro try to get to the rooftop to help the Akazayas but Queen and King get in their way. The rest of the Straw Hats arrive, the whole crew assembles and Luffy vows to take down Kaido.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048178.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e45", "season" => 2021, "number" => 45, "name" => "A Risky Invitation! A Plot to Eliminate Queen", "airdate" => "28 Nov 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Who's-Who tries to bring Drake and Hawkins on board to kill Queen. Meanwhile, the Straw Hats are facing two large monsters that remind them of the Giant who they once struggled to take down. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048250.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e46", "season" => 2021, "number" => 46, "name" => "A New Rivalry! Nami and Ulti!", "airdate" => "5 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Drake vows to fight alongside Luffy's side, but Zoro becomes skeptical and challenges him to a fight. Meanwhile, Nami confronts Ulti, who is angered since her brother was attacked. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048275.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e47", "season" => 2021, "number" => 47, "name" => "A Heroic Blade! Akazaya vs. Kaido, Again Once More!", "airdate" => "12 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Queen uses a new version of the Plague Bullets which will turn the samurai into monsters. Meanwhile, the Minks keep pushing the fight against the Gifters and drive Jack into a corner. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048294.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2021e48", "season" => 2021, "number" => 48, "name" => "An Inherited Technique! Unleashing Oden's Secret Swordplay!", "airdate" => "19 Dec 2021", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "While Luffy rushes to the roof and Yamato tries to catch up with Momonosuke to protect him, the Akazayas finally confront Kaido. Hearing Kaido taunt them for their weakness, the samurais attack him relentlessly.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048306.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2022, "name" => "#1005 - #1045", "rating" => 8.5, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2022e1", "season" => 2022, "number" => 1, "name" => "The Power of Ice Oni! A New Version of the Plague Rounds!", "airdate" => "9 Jan 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Queen blazes away at Zoro and Drake with a special version of the Plague Rounds. Meanwhile, Luffy and Sanji run into another Headliner with a special ability on their way to the rooftop.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048309.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e2", "season" => 2022, "number" => 2, "name" => "I Won't Forgive Him! Chopper's Determination!", "airdate" => "16 Jan 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "King orders his subordinates to go after Momonosuke. Meanwhile, seeing people suffering from Queen's Plague Rounds, Chopper is determined to save everyone.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048318.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e3", "season" => 2022, "number" => 3, "name" => "Zoro's Pursuit! Ice Oni Tag", "airdate" => "23 Jan 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Yamato fights Sasaki to protect Momonosuke. In the meantime, Zoro tries to get rid of the Gifters who have turned into Ice Oni, but Queen starts a horrible game that involves the antibody for the virus.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048326.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e4", "season" => 2022, "number" => 4, "name" => "Nami Surrenders?! Ulti's Fierce Headbutt!", "airdate" => "30 Jan 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Ulti and Page One  chase Nami and Usopp. Cornered, Nami gives in and Ulti pushes her to say the unthinkable.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048560.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e5", "season" => 2022, "number" => 5, "name" => "Sasaki's Onslaught - Armored Division vs. Yamato", "airdate" => "6 Feb 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Carrot and Wanda help Marco, who is cornered by Big Mom and Perospero. In the meantime, Yamato fights against Sasaki in order to protect Shinobu and Momonosuke.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048561.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e6", "season" => 2022, "number" => 6, "name" => "Eliminate the Ice Oni! Chopper's Fire Trick!", "airdate" => "13 Feb 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Zoro and Drake continue to chase Apoo to get the antibody against Ice Oni. In the castle, Luffy, Jimbei and Sanji are climbing up the stairs to reach the rooftop.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048566.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e7", "season" => 2022, "number" => 7, "name" => "It's Not Okay! The Spider lures Sanji!", "airdate" => "20 Feb 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Sanji hears a woman's scream for help and rushes into the room the scream can be heard from. However, it's a trap set up by Black Maria of the Tobi Roppo. How will Sanji get out of this sticky situation?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048571.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e8", "season" => 2022, "number" => 8, "name" => "A Turnaround Move! The Flames of Marco the Phoenix!", "airdate" => "27 Feb 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "While Kaido begins the New Onigashima Project and makes the island float, Marco appears in front of Chopper and the others, who are struggling with Ice Oni.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048581.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e9", "season" => 2022, "number" => 9, "name" => "Yamato's Past - The Man Who Came for an Emperor of the Sea", "airdate" => "6 Mar 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Yamato tells Momonosuke and Shinobu that he once met Ace, who came to Onigashima looking to get Kaido's head. Yamato and Ace engaged in a fierce battle that eventually turned into an important friendship.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048582.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e10", "season" => 2022, "number" => 10, "name" => "Marco's Tears! The Bond of the Whitebeard Pirates!", "airdate" => "17 Apr 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Marco helps Zoro get to the rooftop where Kaido and Big Mom are waiting for their opponents. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048583.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e11", "season" => 2022, "number" => 11, "name" => "Straw Hat Luffy! The Man Who Will Become the King of the Pirates!", "airdate" => "24 Apr 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Yamato tells Momonosuke about how Ace gave him hope for the future. Meanwhile, Luffy and the other allied pirates from the Worst Generation make it to the rooftop to finally face off against Kaido and Big Mom.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048585.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e12", "season" => 2022, "number" => 12, "name" => "The Battle of the Monsters! The Three Stubborn Captains", "airdate" => "8 May 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Luffy's strong attack reminds Kaido of all the strong opponents he has faced. Meanwhile, Sanji is caught and interrogated by Black Maria.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048637.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e13", "season" => 2022, "number" => 13, "name" => "A Barrage of Powerful Techniques! The Fierce Attacks of the Worst Generation!", "airdate" => "15 May 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.9, "summary" => "Luffy, Law, Kid, Zoro and Killer keep landing hard blows against Kaido in tandem despite the arguing. However, when Big Mom steps in and unleashes powerful lightning strikes, the tide turns for all except one of the rookies.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048646.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e14", "season" => 2022, "number" => 14, "name" => "Kaido Laughs! The Emperors of the Sea vs. the New Generation!", "airdate" => "22 May 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Luffy batters Kaido with his Kong Gatling and delivers a final blow using all his strength. Big Mom tries to fight back, but Law gets in her way.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048657.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e15", "season" => 2022, "number" => 15, "name" => "Otama's Secret Plan! Operation Kibi Dango!", "airdate" => "29 May 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "Tama wondered if there was anything she could do to help the Straw Hats and the samurai. Now that she's here on Onigashima, it's time to execute her powerful plan – Operation Kibi Dango!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048678.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e16", "season" => 2022, "number" => 16, "name" => "Sanji's Scream! An SOS Echoes Over the Island!", "airdate" => "5 Jun 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Sanji is captured and tortured by the Black Maria. She wants him to hand over Robin to her. Meanwhile, Carrot and Wanda continue their fight against Perospero. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048688.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e17", "season" => 2022, "number" => 17, "name" => "Spank Strikes! Sanji's Woman-trouble!", "airdate" => "12 Jun 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Robin bursts in to rescue Sanji from the fangs of Black Maria. In the meantime, Yamato, Momonosuke and Shinobu are spotted hiding by the enemy and are forced to fight their pursuers.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048691.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e18", "season" => 2022, "number" => 18, "name" => "No Regrets! Luffy and Boss, a Master-Disciple Bond!", "airdate" => "19 Jun 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Chopper creates and tries the antidote for Ice Oni while Law, Kid, Zoro and Killer continue their battle against Big Mom and Kaido on the roof of the Skull Dome.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048695.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e19", "season" => 2022, "number" => 19, "name" => "All Set! Chopperphage Nebulizer!", "airdate" => "3 Jul 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "While the captains of the Worst Generation still struggle against Kaido and Big Mom, Chopper finally manages to cure the samurai and Beast Pirates infected by Ice Oni.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048697.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e20", "season" => 2022, "number" => 20, "name" => "Oden Appears! The Confused Hearts of the Akazaya Members!", "airdate" => "10 Jul 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 6.8, "summary" => "The wounded Akazaya members are surprised to see Kozuki Oden alive. They were disappointed by their failure to take down Kaido, but now with their lord, they are filled with hope to face their sworn enemy again. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048699.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e21", "season" => 2022, "number" => 21, "name" => "The Worst Generation Gets Wiped Out?! The Emperors' Deadly Attack!", "airdate" => "17 Jul 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The Akazaya try to save Momonosuke but Jack stands in their way. Meanwhile, Chopper and Marco team up to take down Queen and the fierce battle on the rooftop rages on.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048700.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e22", "season" => 2022, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Supernovas Strike Back! The Mission to Tear Apart the Emperors!", "airdate" => "24 Jul 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "While the Akazaya take on Orochi, the members of the Worst Generation continue to fight against the Emperors. They try to separate Kaido and Big Mom to increase their chances of victory.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048701.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e23", "season" => 2022, "number" => 23, "name" => "Protect Luffy! Zoro and Law's Sword Technique", "airdate" => "31 Jul 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "After Big Mom was pushed off of the island the furious battle against Kaido continues. When Kaido tries to beat up the unconscious Luffy, Zoro launches an all-out attack to protect his captain.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048705.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e24", "season" => 2022, "number" => 24, "name" => "Surpass the Emperor of the Sea! Luffy Strikes Back with an Iron Fist!", "airdate" => "7 Aug 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "The Worst Generation and Emperors scatter across Onigashima, preparing for new fights. Kid prepares to battle Big Mom, Killer fights Hawkins, and Luffy decides to take on Kaido all by himself. Meanwhile, Nami, Tama, and Usopp return to the Live Floor, chased…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048711.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e25", "season" => 2022, "number" => 25, "name" => "A Faint Memory - Luffy and Red-Haired's Daughter Uta!", "airdate" => "14 Aug 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Luffy meets Shanks and his daughter Uta for the first time and the two children begin developing their friendship. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048836.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e26", "season" => 2022, "number" => 26, "name" => "A Pledge for the Next Genesis! Luffy and Uta!", "airdate" => "21 Aug 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "After Uta travels with Shanks, she is not aboard when Shanks returns to Foosha Village. This shocks Luffy and he wonders what happened to her. At the same time, news spread that the island Elegia has been mysteriously destroyed.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/419/1048838.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e27", "season" => 2022, "number" => 27, "name" => "Nami Screams - A Deadly Death Race!", "airdate" => "4 Sep 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Luffy and Kaido, who are both using Conqueror's Haki, keep clashing! In the meantime, Usopp, Nami and Tama are being chased by Page One on their way to the Performance Floor. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/421/1052622.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e28", "season" => 2022, "number" => 28, "name" => "The Dawn of the Land of Wano - The All-Out Battle Heats Up!", "airdate" => "11 Sep 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "The Akazaya are rushing to Momonosuke while Yamato tries to lure away the enemies. At the same time, Luffy lands a few punches on Kaido, Chopper struggles against Queen and Ulti faces off against Big Mom.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/421/1054539.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e29", "season" => 2022, "number" => 29, "name" => "The Conclusion! Luffy, Accelerating Fist of the Supreme King", "airdate" => "18 Sep 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Sanji is forced to carry Zoro to the Live Floor, while Nami, Usopp and Big Mom face off against Ulti. On the rooftop, the intense battle between Luffy and Kaido continues.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/422/1056671.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e30", "season" => 2022, "number" => 30, "name" => "Luffy Defeated! The Straw Hats in Jeopardy?!", "airdate" => "25 Sep 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Luffy falls into the sea after being pushed off the rooftop by Kaido. Meanwhile, Zeus intervenes in the fight between Big Mom and Nami's group and Chopper continues to stall Queen on the Live Floor.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/423/1058349.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e31", "season" => 2022, "number" => 31, "name" => "The Animal Kingdom Pirates Trample Down! The End of the Kozuki Clan!", "airdate" => "2 Oct 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "The Straw Hats and their allies receive the news that Luffy lost his battle against Kaido. Meanwhile, Kanjuro disguises himself as Oden again and approaches Momonosuke to destroy the Kozuki lineage. However, Kin'emon amd Kiku stand in his way.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/424/1061185.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e32", "season" => 2022, "number" => 32, "name" => "Fight Against the Dark Night – The Commander-in-chief of the Land of Wano Sounds Off", "airdate" => "16 Oct 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Chopper is discouraged by the news of Luffy's loss and Queen doesn't miss the chance and tries to finish him off. However, Sanji comes to Choppers rescue. Meanwhile, Kin'emon fights for his life to save Momonosuke who makes a big anouncement after escaping!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/426/1066469.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e33", "season" => 2022, "number" => 33, "name" => "Believe in Luffy! The Alliance's Counterattack Begins!", "airdate" => "23 Oct 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Momonosuke and Shinobu run from Kaido while Law and Kid team up against Big Mom. Meanwhile, Nami and Usopp encounter an enemy they thought they had already defeated.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/427/1069060.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e34", "season" => 2022, "number" => 34, "name" => "Nami's Lethal Attack! Otama's Desperate Challenge!", "airdate" => "30 Oct 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "Nami strikes a thunder blast against Ulti to clear their way to the Live Floor. After that Usopp catches one of the Marys and Otama stands up to give a command to the Gifters.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/428/1071568.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e35", "season" => 2022, "number" => 35, "name" => "A Dramatic Increase of Allies! Straw Hats Fight Back!", "airdate" => "6 Nov 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "Hearing Otama's command, the Gifters side with the samurai. Chopper starts to take care of Zoro and Jinbe gets stunned by Who's-Who's story.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/429/1074195.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e36", "season" => 2022, "number" => 36, "name" => "The Pride of a Helmsman – The Enraged Jimbei!", "airdate" => "13 Nov 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "When Who's-Who asks Jimbei a question, he tramples on the dignity of the Fish-Men, causing Jimbei's outrage.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/430/1076948.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e37", "season" => 2022, "number" => 37, "name" => "Showdown Battles of the Monsters! Yamato and Franky", "airdate" => "20 Nov 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Yamato unleashes his true power, Queen bombards Sanji with his cyborg-powers and Sasaki launches tricky attacks against Franky.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/431/1078630.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e38", "season" => 2022, "number" => 38, "name" => "The Predator's Trap - Black Maria's Temptation", "airdate" => "27 Nov 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Suddenly Nico Olvia, Professor Clover and the giant Jaguar D. Saul appear in front of Robin.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/432/1080565.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e39", "season" => 2022, "number" => 39, "name" => "Slash the Nightmare - Brook Draws His Freezing Sword!", "airdate" => "4 Dec 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "In the dense mist, Brook is surprised to see his old friends, the Rumbar Pirates and Laboon. They reminisce about the old days and play music together, however, they suddenly attack Brook.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/433/1082888.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e40", "season" => 2022, "number" => 40, "name" => "Clutch! A Demon Incarnate, Robin!", "airdate" => "11 Dec 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "After enduring Black Maria's physical and mental torture, Robin shows what she is truly capable of as a Demon Child.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/434/1086015.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2022e41", "season" => 2022, "number" => 41, "name" => "A Spell! Kid and Zoro Facing Threats!", "airdate" => "18 Dec 2022", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "While Kid and Law take on Big Mom, Killer battles Hawkins and Sanji stuggles against both King and Queen, who try to go after Zoro while he is still incapacitated. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/435/1089930.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2023, "name" => "#1046 - #1088", "rating" => 8.9, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2023e1", "season" => 2023, "number" => 1, "name" => "Taking a Chance! The Two Arms Go into Battle!", "airdate" => "8 Jan 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Zoro gets back on his feet after taking the instant recovery drug from Zou and confronts King and Queen along with Sanji. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/440/1101417.jpg"),
