        array("id" => "s2023e13", "season" => 2023, "number" => 13, "name" => "The Onslaught of Kazenbo - Orochi's Evil Clutches Close in", "airdate" => "16 Apr 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "Kanjuro's creation, Kazenbo, is wreaking havoc all throughout the Skull Dome, causing panic among Beasts Pirates and samurai, alike.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218762.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e14", "season" => 2023, "number" => 14, "name" => "Zoro's Hardship - A Monster! King the Wildfire", "airdate" => "23 Apr 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Zoro is up against an seemingly unbeatable opponent in King. Not even one of Zoro's most lethal attacks manages to injure him. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218763.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e15", "season" => 2023, "number" => 15, "name" => "Secrets of Enma! The Cursed Sword Entrusted to Zoro", "airdate" => "30 Apr 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "As Zoro recalls his past, the clues from his memory help him realize the secret necessary to truly master Enma. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218764.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e16", "season" => 2023, "number" => 16, "name" => "Attack of the Devil! Sanji vs. Queen", "airdate" => "7 May 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.9, "summary" => "Taking advantage of his scientific enhancements, Sanji discovers a new ability that could prove decisive in his fight with Queen.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218765.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e17", "season" => 2023, "number" => 17, "name" => "King of Hell Three Sword Style - Zoro vs. King", "airdate" => "21 May 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "King recalls his first meeting with his captain and declares that Kaido is the one to become the King of the Pirates, which leads Zoro to set his swords alight with hellfire.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218766.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e18", "season" => 2023, "number" => 18, "name" => "Luffy Accelerates! The Turning Point of a New Era!", "airdate" => "28 May 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Usopp discovers the severely injured Kiku and the upper body of Kinemon. However, they are unable to escape, because they are surrounded by Gifters.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218767.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e19", "season" => 2023, "number" => 19, "name" => "Shuron Hakke! A Lawless Dragon Approaches Luffy!", "airdate" => "4 Jun 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The battle between Luffy and Kaido is becoming increasingly fierce. However, Kaido who is thrilled to have a strong opponent starts drinking too much.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218768.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e20", "season" => 2023, "number" => 20, "name" => "The Destruction of the Alliance?! Fire up, the Will of the New Generation!", "airdate" => "11 Jun 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "With Law and the Kid  worn out and deeply injured, Big Mom tries to get to the rooftop.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218769.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e21", "season" => 2023, "number" => 21, "name" => "The Main Attraction is Coming! Ultimate Attack of Shockwave and Magnetism", "airdate" => "25 Jun 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "After Big Mom recovers from Kid's previous onslaught, she unleashes a potent counterattack that endangers both Law and Kid. Even though they are exhausted, the two rivals start their own desperate attempt to get Big Mom out of Onigashima. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218770.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e22", "season" => 2023, "number" => 22, "name" => "To the New Era! Settled! The Determination of the Brats", "airdate" => "2 Jul 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Big Mom is defeated by Law and Kid, whereupon she falls into the exposed magma chamber below.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218771.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e23", "season" => 2023, "number" => 23, "name" => "Moon Princess Echoes! Wano Country's Final Phase!", "airdate" => "9 Jul 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Kaido mourns Big Mom's defeat and remembers the day he first met her. Meanwhile, Orochi sees the true nature of Komurasaki, the woman he loves, and trembles with fear.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218772.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e24", "season" => 2023, "number" => 24, "name" => "There is Only One Winner - Luffy vs. Kaido", "airdate" => "16 Jul 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "A CP0 agent tries to get to Luffy, but Drake gets in the way. Meanwhile, Luffy, who is running dangerously low on energy, uses his final Gear Four to free the people of Wano from Kaido.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218773.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e25", "season" => 2023, "number" => 25, "name" => "Luffy is Defeated?! The Determination of Those Left Behind", "airdate" => "30 Jul 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The battle between Luffy and Kaido comes to an unexpected end. After Kaido descends, he informs everyone that Luffy has lost.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218774.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e26", "season" => 2023, "number" => 26, "name" => "Luffy's Peak Attained! Gear 5", "airdate" => "6 Aug 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "As Luffy's heart pounds in a funny way, the Five Elders reveal the secret behind the Gum-Gum Fruit. Meanwhile, Orochi tries to convince Komurasaki to escape with him, but when he sees Kanjuro, he makes a malicious decision.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218775.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e27", "season" => 2023, "number" => 27, "name" => "The Ridiculous Power! Gear Five in Full Play", "airdate" => "13 Aug 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "While Luffy enjoys his new, bizarre power, Kaido is perplexed and can't make sense of it. As they wait for Luffy to win, Kid, Law, and the other allies carry on with the battle below.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218776.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e28", "season" => 2023, "number" => 28, "name" => "Nowhere to Run! Hell on Onigashima!", "airdate" => "20 Aug 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Raizo and Jimbei work together to put out the fire that has spread throughout Onigashima.  ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218777.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e29", "season" => 2023, "number" => 29, "name" => "Believe in Momo - Luffy's Final Powerful Technique!", "airdate" => "3 Sep 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Momonosuke struggles to create flame clouds to sustain Onigashima. To fulfill his promise tothe people of Wano, Luffy inflates his fist to strike Kaido.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218778.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e30", "season" => 2023, "number" => 30, "name" => "Twenty Years of Prayer! Reclaim Wano Country", "airdate" => "10 Sep 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "As Luffy and Kaido prepare their final attack, Momonosuke is tasked with moving Onigashima out of the way of Luffy's attack. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218779.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e31", "season" => 2023, "number" => 31, "name" => "The World That Luffy Wants!", "airdate" => "17 Sep 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Kaido recalls being treated unfairly in the past and his vision of the ideal world. While his friends fight to survive on Onigashima, Luffy is asked by Kaido to imagine his ideal world.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218780.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e32", "season" => 2023, "number" => 32, "name" => "Closing the Curtain! Winner - Straw Hat Luffy!", "airdate" => "24 Sep 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The samurai and the Straw Hats shout for joy as they hear that Luffy defeated Kaido. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218781.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e33", "season" => 2023, "number" => 33, "name" => "Return! Shogun of Wano Country - Kozuki Momonosuke", "airdate" => "1 Oct 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "When Kinemon and the other samurai who were thought to be dead emerge from the smoke, the residents of the Flower Capital become baffled. Momonosuke then announces to their victory and the return of the Kozuki Family to the citizens.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218782.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e34", "season" => 2023, "number" => 34, "name" => "Dawn Has Come! Luffy and Friends Rest", "airdate" => "15 Oct 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "As the Five Elders learn of Wano's status, a festival is held to celebrate the alliance's victory. Meanwhile, an Admiral heads to Wano. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218783.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e35", "season" => 2023, "number" => 35, "name" => "The Festival Banquet! New Emperors of the Sea", "airdate" => "22 Oct 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The news of the defeat of the Emperors of the Sea spreads across the world. Luffy enjoys the banquet but just as he is about to make a toast, an enraged Kid comes in to strike him. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218784.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e36", "season" => 2023, "number" => 36, "name" => "The World in Flames! The Navy Admiral's Attack!", "airdate" => "29 Oct 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The Akazaya attempt to stop Admiral Ryokugyu as he approaches the Flower Capital, but he outclasses them with his Devil Fruit power. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218785.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e37", "season" => 2023, "number" => 37, "name" => "A New Era Arrives! The Fury of Red-Haired Yonko", "airdate" => "5 Nov 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Momonosuke and the Akazaya try to defend the Land of Wano against Admiral Ryokugyu, but they get driven into a corner.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/487/1218786.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e38", "season" => 2023, "number" => 38, "name" => "The World That Moves On! A New Organization, Cross Guild!", "airdate" => "12 Nov 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The Straw Hats are surprised when Robin tells them about the Ancient Weapon Pluton. Kid reveals that a new criminal organization, the Cross Guild, has emerged.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/488/1222393.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e39", "season" => 2023, "number" => 39, "name" => "The Time of Departure - The Land of Wano and the Straw Hat Pirates!", "airdate" => "19 Nov 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Zoro visits Yasuie's grave, where he encounters Hiyori, while Luffy visits the ruins of Oden Castle. Later, Luffy and Tama eat red-bean soup together for the last time ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/488/1222394.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e40", "season" => 2023, "number" => 40, "name" => "The Last Curtain! Luffy and Momonosuke's Vow", "airdate" => "26 Nov 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The Straw Hat Pirates say their final goodbyes to Momonosuke, Kinemon, and Yamato, and formally declare Wano Country as one of their territories.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/488/1222433.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e41", "season" => 2023, "number" => 41, "name" => "A New Emperor! Buggy the Genius Jester!", "airdate" => "3 Dec 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The Straw Hat Pirates' new bounties are revealed. Meanwhile, Crocodile and  Mihawk, visit Buggy to discuss their newly-established organization, Cross Guild.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1273573.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e42", "season" => 2023, "number" => 42, "name" => "The War on the Island of Women! A Case Involving Koby the Hero", "airdate" => "10 Dec 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "With the aid of their new Seraphim Pacifista, the Marines invade Amazon Lily with the intention of apprehending Pirate Empress Boa Hancock. But the Blackbeard Pirates make an appearance on Amazon Lily as well.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1273574.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2023e43", "season" => 2023, "number" => 43, "name" => "Luffy's Dream", "airdate" => "17 Dec 2023", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The three-way struggle between the Navy, the Blackbeard Pirates, and the Kuja Pirates comes to an end when an unexpected figure shows up. On the Sunny, the Straw Hats talk about the recent incidents around the world and Luffy's words surprise everyone.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1273575.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2024, "name" => "#1089 - #1122", "rating" => 8.9, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2024e1", "season" => 2024, "number" => 1, "name" => "Entering a New Chapter! Luffy and Sabo's Paths!", "airdate" => "7 Jan 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Sabo, the Chief of Staff of the Revolutionary Army, contacts Koala and everyone in Kamabakka Queendom. He explains to them about the things that he is accused of, but someone who was eavesdropping on the call takes a stunning action.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1281341.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e2", "season" => 2024, "number" => 2, "name" => "A New Island! Future Island Egghead", "airdate" => "14 Jan 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Luffy and Chopper fall into the rough cold sea along with the mysterious girl. Jimbei tries to help them but another attack comes from the unknown creature. Meanwhile, the Sunny is hit by torpedoes and the rest of the Straw Hats are thrown into the sea, too.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438859.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e3", "season" => 2024, "number" => 3, "name" => "Brimming with the Future! An Adventure on the Island of Science!", "airdate" => "21 Jan 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "A young girl who came out of the big robot names herself Dr. Vegapunk and it surprises Franky and the rest of the Straw Hats. Meanwhile, Luffy's group gets to the surface of the island where futuristic buildings stand and unknown giant creatures wander about.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438860.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e4", "season" => 2024, "number" => 4, "name" => "Bonney's Lamentation! Darkness Lurking on the Future Island", "airdate" => "28 Jan 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "While Luffy and the others are enjoying the futuristic machines of Egghead, someone who resembles Bartholomew Kuma comes after them. When Luffy tries to fight back, Bonney stops him and reveals her shocking relationship with Kuma.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438861.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e5", "season" => 2024, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Winner Takes All! Law vs. Blackbeard!", "airdate" => "11 Feb 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The Blackbeard Pirates ambushed the Heart Pirates led by Law. The Blackbeard Pirates' top officers use a variety of formidable Devil Fruit powers and keep pushing the Heart Pirates in order to obtain the copies of the Road Ponegliffs.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438863.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e6", "season" => 2024, "number" => 6, "name" => "The Mystery Deepens! Egghead Labophase", "airdate" => "18 Feb 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "The Straw Hats without Luffy, Chopper, and Jimbei are taken to the laboratory on the clouds far above the ground by Lilith. They get excited about the things they've never seen before. However, inside the laboratory, a new threat is waiting for them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438864.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e7", "season" => 2024, "number" => 7, "name" => "The Brain of a Genius - Six Vegapunks!", "airdate" => "25 Feb 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Nami and the others are attacked by a Pacifista who resembles Jimbei and while they're in battle, some of Vegapunk's Satellites look on with excitement. Meanwhile, Luffy and the others find something extraordinary at the scrap heap.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438865.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e8", "season" => 2024, "number" => 8, "name" => "A Forbidden Piece of History! A Theory Concerning a Kingdom", "airdate" => "3 Mar 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Vegapunk Shaka shares with Robin and the others his theory about an ancient kingdom and the 100-Year Void. He even says that he visited Ohara after its destruction. Meanwhile, Luffy and Chopper try to activate the giant robot and something surprising happens.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438866.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e9", "season" => 2024, "number" => 9, "name" => "The Will of Ohara! The Inherited Research", "airdate" => "17 Mar 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Shaka reveals the secret behind the foundation of the Revolutionary Army and how the relationship between Vegapunk and Dragon affected it. Meanwhile, Vegapunk explains to Luffy and the others about his special power and how his clones work.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438868.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e10", "season" => 2024, "number" => 10, "name" => "The Eccentric Dream of a Genius!", "airdate" => "24 Mar 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Vegapunk reveals the shocking history of the ancient giant robot and asks Luffy to take him off Egghead. Rob Lucci and his fellow Cipher Pol agents arrive at the island and ask for permission to enter the port.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438869.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e11", "season" => 2024, "number" => 11, "name" => "Preparations for Interception! Rob Lucci Strikes!", "airdate" => "31 Mar 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "CP-0 led by Rob Lucci makes a forced landing at Egghead and people on the Fabriophase are plunged into confusion while Shaka and the others prepare to fight back on the Labophase. The enraged Atlas stands up to defend the peace of the island.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438870.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e12", "season" => 2024, "number" => 12, "name" => "Powers on a Different Level! Luffy vs. Lucci!", "airdate" => "7 Apr 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Lucci is instructed not to confront Luffy until Kizaru arrives with reinforcements, but the two attack each other with their newly awakened Devil Fruit forms. Meanwhile, Vegapunk reveals the shocking truth about the Gum-Gum Fruit. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1281667.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e13", "season" => 2024, "number" => 13, "name" => "The Strongest Form of Humanity! The Seraphim's Powers!", "airdate" => "21 Apr 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Vegapunk explains how he managed to grant the Seraphim Devil Fruit powers. Meanwhile, Luffy is still facing Lucci in his awakened form, as the rocket to the Labophase is about to leave.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/515/1289087.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e14", "season" => 2024, "number" => 14, "name" => "Sinister Schemes! The Operation to Escape Egghead", "airdate" => "28 Apr 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Lucci orders his troops to block off all Vegapunk's escape routes and looks to invade the Labophase. Elsewhere, at the Red Line, Kuma crashes into the Red Port. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/517/1292895.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e15", "season" => 2024, "number" => 15, "name" => "Turn Back My Father! Bonney's Futile Wish!", "airdate" => "5 May 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Rob Lucci, Stussy and Kaku start attacking the Thousand Sunny. Luffy reunites with Nami and the others. Meanwhile, Bonney is pressing Vegapunk to change back her father Kuma.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/517/1294437.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e16", "season" => 2024, "number" => 16, "name" => "A Desperate Situation! The Seraphim's All-out Attack!", "airdate" => "12 May 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "After the Seraphim appear, Zoro and Brook now face seven powerful opponents. Sanji, Franky, Lilith and Edison head out to regain control of the Seraphim, while Lucci orders them to destroy the lab. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/519/1298836.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e17", "season" => 2024, "number" => 17, "name" => "A Beautiful Act of Treason! The Spy, Stussy", "airdate" => "19 May 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Stussy suddenly knocked out Lucci to the Straw Hats' surprise, and when Shaka reveals her true identity, they're stunned again. Meanwhile, a major incident occurs on an island called Sphinx where Whitebeard came from.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/520/1300621.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e18", "season" => 2024, "number" => 18, "name" => "Trouble Occurs! Seek Dr. Vegapunk!", "airdate" => "26 May 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The Straw Hats and Dr. Vegapunk's Satellites find out that Vegapunk has disappeared and begin searching for him. Meanwhile, Bonney begins exploring her father's memories.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1302960.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e19", "season" => 2024, "number" => 19, "name" => "A Shudder! The Evil Hand Creeping Up on the Laboratory!", "airdate" => "2 Jun 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The search for Dr. Vegapunk continues and gets more complicated when the communications and surveillance goes down, causing Shaka to suspect an intruder. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/522/1305358.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e20", "season" => 2024, "number" => 20, "name" => "Incomprehensible! The Seraphim's Rebellion!", "airdate" => "9 Jun 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "The Seraphim suddenly start attacking the Straw Hats and the Vegapunk Satellites. They are not stopping even when the Satellites order them to. When Luffy and Zoro are cornered, Lucci and Kaku wake up and make them a surprising offer.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/523/1307953.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e21", "season" => 2024, "number" => 21, "name" => "A Tough Decision! An Unusual United Front!", "airdate" => "23 Jun 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Rob Lucci and Kaku ask Luffy and Zoro to uncuff them so they can fight alongside them against the Seraphim, but the two pirates are reluctant to do so.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/524/1311783.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e22", "season" => 2024, "number" => 22, "name" => "Survive! Deadly Combat with the Strongest Form of Humanity!", "airdate" => "30 Jun 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.2, "summary" => "Luffy, Zoro, Rob Lucci and Kaku relentlessly attack the Seraphim, but the they keep getting back up. Meanwhile, Shaka goes to check one place where he thinks Vegapunk might be.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/526/1316486.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e23", "season" => 2024, "number" => 23, "name" => "The Second Ohara! The Mastermind's Ambition!", "airdate" => "7 Jul 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "Stussy and Sentomaru discuss how big the threat that closes in on Egghead is as Luffy and the others keep fighting the uncontrollable Seraphim. Meanwhile, in an underground lab, someone approaches Vegapunk, who is being held captive.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/527/1317564.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e24", "season" => 2024, "number" => 24, "name" => "Clash! Shanks vs. Eustass Kid", "airdate" => "14 Jul 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Kid gives his crew a pep talk before the battle with Shanks. And Shanks also prepares for the battle but learns how his own subordinates do as they like to protect their beloved boss. Finally, Kid has his Damned Punk ready to shoot.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/528/1320610.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e25", "season" => 2024, "number" => 25, "name" => "Run, Koby! A Desperate Escape Strategy!", "airdate" => "28 Jul 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Koby, who is being held captive on the pirate island of Beehive, has the chance to escape but decides to become a decoy to free slaves. Soon pirates from all over the island are after him, as there is a large bounty on his head.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/530/1326039.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e26", "season" => 2024, "number" => 26, "name" => "For the Beloved Pupil - The Fist of Vice Admiral Garp!", "airdate" => "4 Aug 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "A massive warship comes flying towards the Pirate Island of Beehive and Vice Admiral Garp launches a crushing attack to save his pupil Koby.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/530/1326040.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e27", "season" => 2024, "number" => 27, "name" => "The Navy Surprised! The Navy Headquarters' Former Admiral, Kuzan", "airdate" => "11 Aug 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Kuzan stands in the way of Garp who came to rescue Koby. He was once Garp's pupil, but has now sided with Blackbeard.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/532/1330195.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e28", "season" => 2024, "number" => 28, "name" => "Let's Go Get It! Buggy's Big Declaration", "airdate" => "18 Aug 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "While the Marines deal with the problems caused by the Cross Guild, Buggy gives a passionate speech to Crocodile, Mihawk, and his crew.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/532/1330214.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e29", "season" => 2024, "number" => 29, "name" => "Sabo Returns - The Shocking Truth to Be Told!", "airdate" => "1 Sep 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Sabo starts recounting what happened at Mary Geoise. During the Reverie he witnessed Kuma being the Celestial Dragons' slave.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/538/1345546.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e30", "season" => 2024, "number" => 30, "name" => "The Holy Land in Tumult! Sai and Leo's Full-Power Blow!", "airdate" => "8 Sep 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Sabo runs into Kuma's daughter Bonney. Meanwhile, King Cobra of the Kingdom of Alabasta begins asking the Five Elders questions that trouble them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/538/1345547.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e31", "season" => 2024, "number" => 31, "name" => "The Entrusted Message! King Cobra's Resolve", "airdate" => "15 Sep 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "King Cobra is surprised by seeing someone sitting on the Empty Throne. When he is subject to a deadly attack, Sabo cuts in to save him. ", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/538/1345548.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e32", "season" => 2024, "number" => 32, "name" => "The World Is Shaken! The Ruler's Judgment and the Five Elders' Actions!", "airdate" => "22 Sep 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Vivi and Wapol try to escape Mary Geoise while Sabo also looks for a way to leave to deliver King Cobra's message to Luffy and Vivi. Meanwhile, Imu orders the Five Elders to test a horrendous weapon.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/538/1345549.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e33", "season" => 2024, "number" => 33, "name" => "Garp and Kuzan - A Master and a Pupil's Beliefs Clash", "airdate" => "6 Oct 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "At the Pirate Island of Beehive, Vice Admiral Garp deals with an overwhelming number of pirates alone. As he and his fellow Navy soldiers try to escape the island, the former Navy admiral Kuzan stands in their way.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/539/1349375.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2024e34", "season" => 2024, "number" => 34, "name" => "The Last Lesson! Impact Inherited", "airdate" => "13 Oct 2024", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Avalo Pizarro, who merged with the Pirate Island, reaches his giant hand to crush the Navy ship with many soldiers and civilians on board. The wounded Garp gives orders to Koby, Helmeppo, and Prince Grus, and delivers a powerful blow to save the ship.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/539/1349376.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2025, "name" => "#1123 - #1155", "rating" => 9, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2025e1", "season" => 2025, "number" => 1, "name" => "The World Shakes! The Straw Hats' Hostage Situation", "airdate" => "5 Apr 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "As the news about Garp's disappearance and Luffy's hostage situation spreads, a mysterious earthquake suddenly shakes the entire world. Meanwhile, a huge Navy fleet led by Admiral Kizaru surrounds Egghead and listens in as York contacts Mary Geoise to negotia…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438844.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e2", "season" => 2025, "number" => 2, "name" => "Completely Surrounded! The Operation to Escape Egghead", "airdate" => "6 Apr 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "In the Labophase on Egghead, which is completely surrounded by the Navy, Luffy and the others devise a plan to escape the island. However, the Frontier Dome, the laser defense system, cannot be deactivated without York's secret passcode.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438845.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e3", "season" => 2025, "number" => 3, "name" => "A Clash of Two Men's Determination! Kizaru and Sentomaru", "airdate" => "13 Apr 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Navy Admiral Kizaru finally makes landfall on Egghead and Sentomaru, Vegapunk's bodyguard, stands in his way. The two men who were once close now clash violently. Meanwhile, Luffy and the others try their best to move the Sunny to the back side of the island…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438846.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e4", "season" => 2025, "number" => 4, "name" => "Looming Despair! Admiral Kizaru's Depressing Mission", "airdate" => "20 Apr 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Kuma finally reaches Mary Geoise and keeps advancing even without free will or mind. But Fleet Admiral Akainu stands in his way. On Egghead, Kizaru enters the Labophase and delivers a powerful kick to Luffy who tries to stop him.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438847.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e5", "season" => 2025, "number" => 5, "name" => "Luffy vs. Kizaru! A Fierce Kaleidoscopic Battle", "airdate" => "27 Apr 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "A bizarre battle between Luffy and Kizaru heats up. Meanwhile, in the Fabiriophase, Bonney is all alone and being chased by the Navy soldiers. Dr. Vegapunk sees this and can't help but leave the Labophase to rescue her, risking his life.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438848.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e6", "season" => 2025, "number" => 6, "name" => "The Nightmare Strikes - Godhead of Science & Defense, St. Saturn", "airdate" => "4 May 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Vegapunk successfully wrests back the Pacifistas from the Navy, but another party soon gains control of them. At the same time, Luffy, Zoro, and the others sense an unearthly presence just as a pentagram suddenly appears on Egghead.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438849.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e7", "season" => 2025, "number" => 7, "name" => "Kuma's Past - Better Off Dead in This World", "airdate" => "18 May 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Bonney gets captured by St. Saturn, whose enigmatic power keeps Sanji and Franky from saving her. In St. Saturn's clenched fist, she recalls the memories of her father, Kuma. 47 years ago, Kuma was born to a father of a race on the verge of extinction.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438850.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e8", "season" => 2025, "number" => 8, "name" => "A History Erased! God Valley of Despair", "airdate" => "25 May 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "The human hunt begins and the Celestial Dragons start chasing locals of God Valley and slaves for prizes. Ivankov and Ginny share with Kuma and the others their surprising plan to survive the game. Meanwhile, ships full of infamous pirates start arriving on t…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438853.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e9", "season" => 2025, "number" => 9, "name" => "A Fleeting Moment of Happiness - Kumachi and Ginny", "airdate" => "1 Jun 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Kuma and Ginny live peacefully in the Sorbet Kingdom eight years after the God Valley Incident. However, their new king initiates a policy of enslaving the poor. Kuma tries to free those who were captured but ends up being imprisoned himself. But a familiar f…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438855.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e10", "season" => 2025, "number" => 10, "name" => "A Pledge to Ginny - Kuma Becomes a Father", "airdate" => "8 Jun 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Two years after Ginny's abduction, the Revolutionary Army suddenly receives a call from her.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438857.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e11", "season" => 2025, "number" => 11, "name" => "To Save His Daughter - Kuma the Timid Pacifist", "airdate" => "15 Jun 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "By fighting off King Bekori who is supported by the World Government, Kuma is put on the wanted list and decides to travel around the world in search of a cure for Bonney's disease. He reunites with Dragon and learns about the Government's eccentric scientist…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/575/1438843.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e12", "season" => 2025, "number" => 12, "name" => "Cruel Fate - Kuma's Decision as a Father", "airdate" => "29 Jun 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Taking advantage of Kuma's love for his daughter Bonney, the World Government imposes three harsh conditions on him in exchange for her treatment. Kuma agrees to them and Bonney's treatment starts at Laboratory 8 in tandem with the clone development with whic…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/576/1441294.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e13", "season" => 2025, "number" => 13, "name" => "To the Sea Where My Father is! The Future Bonney Chooses", "airdate" => "6 Jul 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Bonney has been waiting for a letter from her father Kuma who promised to write to her. But with no letters in sight, she turns nine and one day realizes her disease is cured. She then decides to go out to sea to search for her father.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/577/1443372.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e14", "season" => 2025, "number" => 14, "name" => "Kuma's Life", "airdate" => "13 Jul 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Bonney sails out to sea in search of her father and rises to prominence. At the same time, Luffy makes his name by defeating the Arlong Pirates and declaring war against the World Government. Watching his actions, Kuma begins to hold a certain belief.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/578/1446516.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e15", "season" => 2025, "number" => 15, "name" => "I'm Sorry, Dad - Bonney's Tears and Kuma's Fist", "airdate" => "27 Jul 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The present day on Egghead, Bonney is caught in St. Saturn's grasp, knowing he is responsible for her father's transformation into a cyborg. However, Saturn reveals an even more shocking truth that throws Bonney into despair.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/580/1450315.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e16", "season" => 2025, "number" => 16, "name" => "Thank You, Dad - Bonney and Kuma's Warm Embrace", "airdate" => "3 Aug 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Kuma, battered and without free will, approaches Bonney. Overcome with emotion, she tells him she saw all his memories and learned everything that he did for her. Watching the scene, Vegapunk wonders what compelled Kuma to come to Egghead.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/581/1452775.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e17", "season" => 2025, "number" => 17, "name" => "Destroy Egghead - The Buster Call is Invoked", "airdate" => "10 Aug 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "As an order comes down to evacuate the island in preparation for bombardment, Navy soldiers rush to their ships. Meanwhile, Vegapunk pleads with Saturn to halt the attack, arguing how vital the island is for the future of humanity, but Saturn refuses to liste…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/582/1455392.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e18", "season" => 2025, "number" => 18, "name" => "An Admired Hero - The Warrior of Liberation Who Saves Bonney", "airdate" => "17 Aug 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Vegapunk reveals the secret he alone has been keeping regarding the Pacifistas. Meanwhile, Bonney, her back against the wall, hears a familiar rhythm. It's the rhythm that her father taught her along with the legend of the hero he admired.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/644/1611898.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e19", "season" => 2025, "number" => 19, "name" => "Reliable Reinforcements! Dorry and Brogy Arrive!", "airdate" => "24 Aug 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The Giant Pirate Crew led by Dorry and Brogy arrive at Egghead, which deeply moves Usopp and the others. Zoro keeps fighting Rob Lucci and the Pacifistas continues to torment the Navy while Luffy shows Bonney how to throw a real punch.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/644/1611899.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e20", "season" => 2025, "number" => 20, "name" => "Come In, World - Vegapunk's Message", "airdate" => "7 Sep 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Caribou begs Augur and Devon to let him meet Blackbeard. An order is given to the Navy vice admirals to kill Jewelry Bonney at all costs in order to take back control over the Pacifistas. Sanji flees with the injured Vegapunk while Luffy holds St. Saturn back.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/589/1474443.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e21", "season" => 2025, "number" => 21, "name" => "Vegapunk's Secret Plan - A Tense Worldwide Broadcast", "airdate" => "14 Sep 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Suddenly, Vegapunk's broadcast begins and the whole world is taken by surprise. As everyone rushes to set up Video Transponder Snails and screens to watch it, the Five Elders grow concerned and discuss countermeasures.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/644/1611900.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e22", "season" => 2025, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Worst Nightmare - The Five Elders Come Together", "airdate" => "21 Sep 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Just like when St. Saturn emerged on Egghead, black lightning strikes and pentagrams appear again. The Pacifistas are rendered immobile by an unknown shadow. Meanwhile, as the time for the Straw Hats to evacuate the island is drawing near, the fight between Z…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/589/1474442.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e23", "season" => 2025, "number" => 23, "name" => "Friends Fight Together! Luffy and the Warriors of Elbaph", "airdate" => "28 Sep 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Dorry and Brogy finally reunite with Luffy. However, they are still facing St. Saturn and St. Warcury in their alternate forms. Dorry blows a horn to alert his people to prepare to escape, but St. Warcury unleashes a deafening roar.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/589/1474440.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e24", "season" => 2025, "number" => 24, "name" => "An Imminent Threat - Stussy and Edison's Resolve", "airdate" => "19 Oct 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Franky and Bonney clash with Navy vice admirals in front of the Elbaph ship. St. Mars tries to find the room from Vegapunk's broadcast. The heavily injured Stussy tells Kaku the reason she chose to stay behind while Edison takes desperate action to help the S…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/593/1483952.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e25", "season" => 2025, "number" => 25, "name" => "A Stunning Conclusion - Vegapunk's Great Prediction", "airdate" => "26 Oct 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Vegapunk's broadcast resumes as people in various locations all over the world listen closely. St. Mars rushes to find the Transponder Snail that is the source of the broadcast while the Straw Hats and their allies clash with the other members of the Five Eld…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/594/1486725.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e26", "season" => 2025, "number" => 26, "name" => "The Lost History - Joyboy, the First Pirate", "airdate" => "2 Nov 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Vegapunk's revelation sends shockwaves around the world. St. Saturn abandons his fight with Nami and the others and rushes to stop the broadcast at all costs. Vegapunk goes on to expose another stunning truth, this time about Joyboy, the first pirate.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/595/1489811.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e27", "season" => 2025, "number" => 27, "name" => "The Void Century - A Revelation About a Sinking World", "airdate" => "9 Nov 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The severely injured Edison begs Stussy to escape, but she makes a stunning request in exchange. Meanwhile, Vegapunk presents another astonishing disclosure about a past cataclysm and the Ancient Weapons that will fundamentally challenge the beliefs of people…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/597/1493185.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e28", "season" => 2025, "number" => 28, "name" => "Get the Ship Moving! The Iron Giant Activates", "airdate" => "16 Nov 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Vegapunk's revelation shocks even Koby and his fellow SWORD members, leading them to discuss what to do next.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/598/1496481.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e29", "season" => 2025, "number" => 29, "name" => "Her and Her Father's Dream! Bonney's Free Future", "airdate" => "30 Nov 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Luffy finally hops on the Elbaph ship along with Dorry and Brogy, but the Five Elders catch up to them and begin their assault. Aboard the burning ship, Bonney hears a familiar sound and then finds a new strength in her memories of her father.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/601/1502618.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e30", "season" => 2025, "number" => 30, "name" => "Her Father and Mother's Legacy! Bonney's Nika Punch", "airdate" => "7 Dec 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Zoro and the others who are on the Sunny in the Labophase finally attempt to escape, but at the cost of an unexpected sacrifice. Meanwhile, as Vegapunk concludes his speech, Bonney once again faces St. Saturn, the object of her great hatred.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/602/1506040.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e31", "season" => 2025, "number" => 31, "name" => "The Upheaval of an Era! The Color of the Supreme King That Leads Luffy", "airdate" => "14 Dec 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Vegapunk's speech raises the spirits of the pirates across the world, infuriating the Navy and the civilians. However, the broadcast is suddenly cut off while Vegapunk is still speaking. Meanwhile, off the coast of Egghead, the Five Elders are about to delive…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/603/1508856.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e32", "season" => 2025, "number" => 32, "name" => "The Truth Behind the Secret Plan - Vegapunk Claims Victory", "airdate" => "21 Dec 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Two weeks before the battle erupted on Egghead, Vegapunk found out someone stole a portion of the Mother Flame. Along with Pythagoras and Shaka, he launched an investigation and identified the culprit, also learning their shocking motivation. Then, for the fu…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/604/1511490.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2025e33", "season" => 2025, "number" => 33, "name" => "The Promised Horizon - Off to the Long-Awaited Elbaph", "airdate" => "28 Dec 2025", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "York wakes up to see Island Clouds rising, and to her surprise, something is about to be taken away. Meanwhile, at Mary Geoise, the Celestial Dragons realize their food stock is dwindling and become belligerent. Another one of Vegapunk's Satellites, Lilith wa…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/605/1513991.jpg"),
