        array("id" => "s2026e11", "season" => 2026, "number" => 11, "name" => "Encountering Loki - Gunko of the Knights of God", "airdate" => "14 Jun 2026", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Amidst the roaring banquet with the Giants, Luffy hears the legend of the Sun God passed down in Elbaph and learns why Loki is being held captive. In the Underworld, two mysterious guests appear before Loki, expressing their desire to recruit him into their o…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/632/1580530.jpg"),
